":{"login":"Daniber11","providerType":"User"},"email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-03T02:37:05Z","committedDate":"2026-09-03T02:37:05Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"Daniber11","providerType":"User"},"email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:30:53.298Z","repositoryId":1356229815,"sha":"288f6e8a8b2e0fa4630fa68441323392d82273a0"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:30:53.298Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/15f0590a25f855625ba2a2089e39f27324b12f02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T20:05:31Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T20:05:31Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"feat(frontend): unifica la identidad visual en un tema compartido\n\nEl tema vive ahora en `shared` y lo consumen host y remoto: dos\ncreateTheme distintos producian dos escalas de color y de sombra, y\nla diferencia se notaba justo en la frontera federada.\n\nPaleta institucional con profundidad, jerarquia tipografica (tracking\nnegativo en titulos, cifras tabulares), sombras en dos capas y radios\nconsistentes. Barra superior con degradado y el rol como pastilla;\ntabla de bandeja con encabezado diferenciado y ancho acotado; chips de\nestado en estilo suave en vez del relleno saturado, que competia entre\nfilas.\n\nEn el resumen analitico: barras con ancho minimo visible (un valor\npequeño frente al maximo quedaba en 1-2 px y parecia cero), etiquetas\npresentadas como texto en vez del identificador crudo de la dimension,\ny el tiempo medio de resolucion convertido en metrica destacada. Se\nigualan alturas de tarjetas en detalle e indicadores.\n\nSe retira el tema morado del remoto standalone: era una sonda de la\nfase 2 para detectar Emotion duplicado, ya verificada.","tree":{"sha":"a87da18b73690e97401e9f06302550309ddaea5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/a87da18b73690e97401e9f06302550309ddaea5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/15f0590a25f855625ba2a2089e39f27324b12f02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/15f0590a25f855625ba2a2089e39f27324b12f02","node_id":"C_kwDOUNZst9oAKDE1ZjA1OTBhMjVmODU1NjI1YmEyYTIwODllMzlmMjczMjRiMTJmMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/bab865c44caef5a4dbc278f93a7ec6b2f1f789a6","sha":"bab865c44caef5a4dbc278f93a7ec6b2f1f789a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/bab865c44caef5a4dbc278f93a7ec6b2f1f789a6"}],"sha":"15f0590a25f855625ba2a2089e39f27324b12f02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/15f0590a25f855625ba2a2089e39f27324b12f02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/bab865c44caef5a4dbc278f93a7ec6b2f1f789a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T19:49:15Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T19:49:15Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"fix(fase-6): activa JaCoCo, corrige Karate y completa evidencia real\n\nJaCoCo estaba declarado pero nunca se ejecutaba (sin executions);\nactivado con prepare-agent + report y exclusiones honestas en ambos\nservicios. Cobertura real capturada: domain 80%, application 64%,\nindicadores-service 27%.\n\nTres tests nuevos de casos de uso (Tomar, Transicionar,\nAgregarObservacion) fallaban por eventos de dominio sin drenar en el\nfixture del setup; corregido drenando antes de cada prueba.\n\nKarate no arrancaba por XML invalido en pom.xml (comentario con\n\"--build\"). Al arrancar, fallaba en dos capas: karate.call no inyecta\nargumentos en tiempo de arranque (corregido con karate.set), y el\ntoken quedaba con el issuer interno de Docker en vez del que validan\nlos backends, por el header Host que ve Keycloak al emitirlo\n(corregido forzando Host: localhost:8080). Verificado contra el stack\nreal: 8/8 escenarios, 0 fallos (A1, A3, recorrido con A4).\n\nRefs: A1, A2, A3, A4, A5, A7","tree":{"sha":"3b338b6e527877de8737a8a2892017c9bf40faa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/3b338b6e527877de8737a8a2892017c9bf40faa7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/bab865c44caef5a4dbc278f93a7ec6b2f1f789a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://gith