/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/9ada6c0555afbffbbe6e58ff030c8e944f2009d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:09:45Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T17:09:45Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"feat(fase-6): entregables de cierre — Docker, Helm, CI, Karate, ADRs y documentación\n\nTrabajo en progreso de la Fase 6 (cierre y entregables): Dockerfiles\nmulti-stage no-root para los cuatro componentes con el compose.yaml\ncompleto; suite de aceptación Karate (A1, A3, recorrido\nREGISTRADA→EN_ATENCION→RESUELTA con A4); chart de Helm validado con\nhelm lint/template; pipeline .gitlab-ci.yml (lint→build→test→coverage→\npackage con Kaniko→helm-validate→deploy manual); los once ADRs de\nBLUEPRINT.md §13; diagramas C4 de contexto, contenedores y secuencia\nen Mermaid; README y USO_DE_IA.md completados; tres pruebas de caso de\nuso que faltaban (Tomar, Transicionar, AgregarObservación) para que la\ncobertura de JaCoCo pendiente de generar sea honesta.\n\nRefs: A1, A3, A4, A7","tree":{"sha":"4be95d908dca9589b2e8a8ac842150b5c44b1d40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/4be95d908dca9589b2e8a8ac842150b5c44b1d40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/9ada6c0555afbffbbe6e58ff030c8e944f2009d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/