{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/e565c3b68c5da431311d08a54ae3198daf658aae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:21:17Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:21:17Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"feat(frontend): construye la interfaz completa sobre el shell federado\n\nFase 5: autenticacion Authorization Code + PKCE con token en memoria\n(nunca localStorage/sessionStorage) y authBridge expuesto por Module\nFederation; capa de datos RTK Query con validacion Zod nativa de toda\nrespuesta del backend; cinco vistas (bandeja, creacion, detalle con\nlinea de tiempo y acciones por rol, resumen analitico federado);\nEstadoVista/EstadoChip compartidos y documentados en Storybook; 30\npruebas Vitest.\n\nDiez defectos reales encontrados y corregidos probando en un navegador\nlimpio, no solo revisando el codigo: duplicacion de UserManager entre\nshell y remoto por los limites de \"shared\" en Module Federation, dos\ncarreras distintas (hidratacion del authBridge, token vs Redux en el\nprimer fetch del remoto), el logout que no cerraba la sesion real de\nKeycloak mas la carrera de RutaProtegida que eso desato, el 404 de\nrecarga en ruta profunda que el escenario A6 existe para atrapar, el\ncallback de renovacion silenciosa mal manejado, y el foco que no\nentraba al dialogo de observaciones pese al autoFocus declarado.\n\nRefs: A6","tree":{"sha":"13a79b8d0149f39c1ce7cc58dbd1ec4896d2e43f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/13a79b8d0149f39c1ce7cc58dbd1ec4896d2e43f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/e565c3b68c5da431311d08a54ae3198daf658aae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/e565c3b68c5da431311d08a54ae3198daf658aae","node_id":"C_kwDOUNZst9oAKGU1NjVjM2I2OGM1ZGE0MzEzMTFkMDhhNTRhZTMxOThkYWY2NThhYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/005ed084aa0a814347aa56e9ce129ea89f0c5c30","sha":"005ed084aa0a814347aa56e9ce129ea89f0c5c30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/005ed084aa0a814347aa56e9ce129ea89f0c5c30"}],"sha":"e565c3b68c5da431311d08a54ae3198daf658aae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/e565c3b68c5da431311d08a54ae3198daf658aae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/005ed084aa0a814347aa56e9ce129ea89f0c5c30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T14:47:45Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T14:47:45Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"feat(indicadores): implementa el modelo de lectura con consumo idempotente\n\nFase 4. Servicio de Indicadores completo: esquema en estrella, proyector de\neventos y consumidor idempotente que resuelve el escenario A5.\n\nArquitectura en capas y no hexagonal a proposito (ADR-003): sin dominio que\nproteger, separar puertos y adaptadores aqui solo agregaria ceremonia. La\nunica logica propia es TipoDeEvento, la traduccion entre el nombre del hecho\ny las claves de dimension que le corresponden.\n\ndim_fecha se puebla de forma perezosa en vez de por rango sembrado, para que\nno tenga fecha de caducidad. dim_categoria replica el catalogo con una fila\nDESCONOCIDA de respaldo. La topologia de RabbitMQ se declara tambien desde el\nconsumidor porque las declaraciones AMQP son idempotentes entre si.\n\nDos defectos reales corregidos durante la verificacion de A5:\n\n- La idempotencia no funcionaba pese a aparentarlo. save() sobre una entidad\n  con identificador ASIGNADO (el eventId lo pone el productor, no la base)\n  degenera en merge(): Spring Data hace SELECT y UPDATE, nunca INSERT, asi\n  que la clave primaria nunca se violaba. hecho_transicion crecia con cada\n  reenvio mientras evento_procesado se quedaba quieto, aparentando estar\n  bien. Corregido con un INSERT nativo explicito.\n\n- Un mensaje ilegible se reintentaba tres veces con el backoff completo antes\n  de llegar a la DLQ. AmqpRejectAndDontRequeueException evita que el mensaje\n  vuelva a la cola, pero no evita el reintento: el interceptor de Spring AMQP\n  envuelve cualquier excepcion del listener y solo decide \"sin reencolar\" al\n  agotar los intentos. Un JSON malformado no mejora reintentandolo. Corregido\n  con una politica de reintento que excluye esa excepcion explicitamente.\n\nVerificado con datos reales, no con inspeccion de codigo: reenviar un evento\nya procesado, con su eventId original, deja los conteos identicos y la\nproyeccion sin crecer; un payload invalido llega a la DLQ en un solo intento.\n\nRefs: A5","tree":{"sha":"a090adaf4b5e945abb0556a1c7ff81f6e27e5d6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/a090adaf4b5e945abb0556a1c7ff81f6e27e5d6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/005ed084aa0a814347aa56e9ce129ea89f0c5c30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/005ed084aa0a814347aa56e9ce129ea89f0c5c30","node_id":"C_kwDOUNZst9oAKDAwNWVkMDg0YWEwYTgxNDM0N2FhNTZlOWNlMTI5ZWE4OWYwYzVjMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/bf64917455a62b4dfadc3118c59c78764b5f3ad3","sha":"bf64917455a62b4dfadc3118c59c78764b5f3ad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/bf64917455a62b4dfadc3118c59c78764b5f3ad3"}],"sha":"005ed084aa0a814347aa56e9ce129ea89f0c5c30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/005ed084aa0a814347aa56e9ce129ea89f0c5c30"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/bf64917455a62b4dfadc3118c59c78764b5f3ad3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T05:10:23Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T05:10:23Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"feat(solicitudes): implementa el servicio con arquitectura hexagonal estricta\n\nFase 3. Servicio de Solicitudes completo: dominio, casos de uso, persistencia,\noutbox transaccional, REST y seguridad.\n\nEstructura en cuatro modulos Maven. El pom de domain no declara ninguna\ndependencia de produccion, y ArquitecturaTest verifica con nueve reglas que la\nregla de dependencia se cumpla: un import de Spring en el nucleo rompe el build.\n\nLa tabla de transiciones vive en el enum Accion y no en EstadoSolicitud, porque\nuna accion necesita declarar su estado de ORIGEN. Desde RESUELTA se llega a\nEN_ATENCION, pero solo mediante DEVOLVER; con una tabla indexada por destino,\nTOMAR sobre una solicitud resuelta se habria aceptado por error.\n\nLos casos de uso son clases planas sin anotaciones de Spring. La transaccion se\naplica desde el cableado con decoradores sobre TransactionTemplate, que caben en\nuna lambda porque los puertos de entrada tienen un solo metodo.\n\nEl outbox se escribe en la misma transaccion del agregado y lo declara con\nPropagation.MANDATORY. Esa anotacion atrapo el defecto mas grave de la fase:\n@Transactional sobre un metodo @Bean no hace transaccional al objeto devuelto,\nasi que los eventos se habrian escrito fuera de transaccion en silencio.\n\nEscenarios verificados contra el stack real con tokens de Keycloak:\n- A1: 201, estado REGISTRADA, historial e evento en el outbox\n- A2: dos analistas en paralelo, uno 201 y otro 409, sin doble asignacion\n- A3: 403 sin cambios persistidos ni eventos emitidos\n- A4: 422 con Problem Details explicativo\n- Recorrido completo incluyendo devolucion, e idempotencia HTTP\n\n43 pruebas en verde. Evidencia reproducible en docs/evidencias/.\n\nRefs: A1, A2, A3, A4","tree":{"sha":"74eb87f2f7f3644a48f66cd978fe69dd3c4464e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/74eb87f2f7f3644a48f66cd978fe69dd3c4464e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/bf64917455a62b4dfadc3118c59c78764b5f3ad3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/bf64917455a62b4dfadc3118c59c78764b5f3ad3","node_id":"C_kwDOUNZst9oAKGJmNjQ5MTc0NTVhNjJiNGRmYWRjMzExOGM1OWM3ODc2NGI1ZjNhZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/079cad635bc29d2483d7614d042fcdc967699854","sha":"079cad635bc29d2483d7614d042fcdc967699854","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/079cad635bc29d2483d7614d042fcdc967699854"}],"sha":"bf64917455a62b4dfadc3118c59c78764b5f3ad3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/bf64917455a62b4dfadc3118c59c78764b5f3ad3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/079cad635bc29d2483d7614d042fcdc967699854/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T03:02:21Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T03:02:21Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"feat(frontend): federa el shell con el microfrontend de indicadores\n\nFase 2. Mitigacion del mayor riesgo tecnico del proyecto: demostrar que\nModule Federation sobre Rspack funciona con React 19 y MUI 7 antes de\nescribir una sola vista real.\n\n- Lista unica de modulos compartidos en apps/frontend/shared, importada por\n  las dos configuraciones. Mantenerla en un solo lugar es lo que impide el\n  desfase entre host y remoto.\n- El remoto expone ./IndicadoresApp y ademas arranca standalone con su propio\n  ThemeProvider, con un color distinto para que una eventual duplicacion de\n  Emotion sea visible a simple vista.\n- Limite de error alrededor del remoto: un remoto caido no deja el shell en\n  blanco, muestra un mensaje accionable.\n- Contrato del modulo remoto declarado a mano en TypeScript, sin any.\n\nTres defectos corregidos durante la fase:\n- MUI viajaba duplicado porque las importaciones profundas no casan con la\n  clave compartida. Se paso a importaciones del barril.\n- MUI seguia sin registrarse en el share scope: resuelve a esm/index.js, cuyo\n  directorio no declara version, asi que habia que declarar version ademas de\n  requiredVersion.\n- El build de produccion daba pantalla en blanco porque el transform de SWC\n  tenia development fijo en true y emitia jsxDEV.\n\nVerificado sobre el build de produccion: las diez entradas del share scope\nreportan proveedor=shell, el remoto no descarga ningun vendor chunk, solo hay\nlos dos caches de Emotion estandar de MUI, el remoto lee el tema del host y la\nconsola queda sin mensajes.\n\nRefs: A6","tree":{"sha":"4ac960fbb68e193aeaab4ab1642782f32c2a5166","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/4ac960fbb68e193aeaab4ab1642782f32c2a5166"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/079cad635bc29d2483d7614d042fcdc967699854","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/079cad635bc29d2483d7614d042fcdc967699854","node_id":"C_kwDOUNZst9oAKDA3OWNhZDYzNWJjMjlkMjQ4M2Q3NjE0ZDA0MmZjZGM5Njc2OTk4NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/05cac397ffb48c053c2eafb7196dafdca02995df","sha":"05cac397ffb48c053c2eafb7196dafdca02995df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/05cac397ffb48c053c2eafb7196dafdca02995df"}],"sha":"079cad635bc29d2483d7614d042fcdc967699854","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/079cad635bc29d2483d7614d042fcdc967699854"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/05cac397ffb48c053c2eafb7196dafdca02995df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:39:36Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:39:36Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"fix(db): fija QUOTED_IDENTIFIER en la migracion del esquema operacional\n\nLos indices filtrados de solicitud(analista_id) y outbox_evento(estado)\nexigen QUOTED_IDENTIFIER y ANSI_NULLS activos. El driver JDBC los activa por\nomision, asi que el defecto habria quedado latente hasta que alguien aplicara\nla migracion con otro cliente.\n\nDetectado al ejecutar V1 contra una base desechable, antes de que Flyway\nexista. Verificado: V1 y V2 crean 6 tablas, 8 indices y 6 semillas sobre una\nbase limpia.","tree":{"sha":"fefbfaf4a16d5d56fd7443a81026a84c768ae172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/fefbfaf4a16d5d56fd7443a81026a84c768ae172"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/05cac397ffb48c053c2eafb7196dafdca02995df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/05cac397ffb48c053c2eafb7196dafdca02995df","node_id":"C_kwDOUNZst9oAKDA1Y2FjMzk3ZmZiNDhjMDUzYzJlYWZiNzE5NmRhZmRjYTAyOTk1ZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11/Softgic/commit/288f6e8a8b2e0fa4630fa68441323392d82273a0","sha":"288f6e8a8b2e0fa4630fa68441323392d82273a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/288f6e8a8b2e0fa4630fa68441323392d82273a0"}],"sha":"05cac397ffb48c053c2eafb7196dafdca02995df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/05cac397ffb48c053c2eafb7196dafdca02995df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMzOTgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/commits/288f6e8a8b2e0fa4630fa68441323392d82273a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:37:05Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T02:37:05Z","email":"77933980+Daniber11@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Daniber11"},"message":"chore(infra): levanta el stack local con SQL Server, RabbitMQ y Keycloak\n\nFase 1. Infraestructura ejecutable, sin logica de negocio todavia.\n\n- compose.yaml en la raiz y sin perfiles, para que \"docker compose up --build\"\n  sea suficiente por si solo. Un servicio con profiles no arranca con ese\n  comando, y de el depende el escenario A7.\n- db-init como servicio de un solo uso: la imagen de SQL Server no crea las\n  bases de aplicacion y Flyway migra un esquema pero no lo crea.\n- Realm solicitudes-gov importado al arrancar, con tres roles, cliente publico\n  shell-web con PKCE S256 y cliente karate-e2e restringido a direct grant y\n  rotulado como exclusivo de pruebas.\n- Migraciones del modelo operacional con seis tablas, ocho indices justificados\n  por una consulta concreta y semillas no sensibles.\n- Sin secretos en el repositorio: .env ignorado, .env.example con valores\n  ficticios rotulados como locales.\n\nVerificado: los tres servicios alcanzan (healthy), db-init termina en 0 y crea\nambas bases, el discovery OIDC responde con PKCE S256, y analista1 obtiene un\ntoken cuyo realm_access.roles contiene ANALISTA.\n\nRefs: A7, A3","tree":{"sha":"18e2663019cff0f88c5ed5e8b9eef1986ee64b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/trees/18e2663019cff0f88c5ed5e8b9eef1986ee64b4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daniber11/Softgic/git/commits/288f6e8a8b2e0fa4630fa68441323392d82273a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77933980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Daniber11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Daniber11","id":77933980,"login":"Daniber11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3OTMz