out after 15 s, and a poll run is skipped while the previous one is still running\n- state roles corrected: timestamps use `value.time` (numeric), text values use `text`\n- departure object names are only written when the line changes, not on every poll","tree":{"sha":"9cde3c0c8a90aba6821b06477ceebf47404e02ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/git/trees/9cde3c0c8a90aba6821b06477ceebf47404e02ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/git/commits/c27424116e728f14ae7f85be049f3782ca95f3ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3136108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper","id":3136108,"login":"aSilentSniper","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzYxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commit/c27424116e728f14ae7f85be049f3782ca95f3ff","node_id":"C_kwDOUNbFfdoAKGMyNzQyNDExNmU3MjhmMTRhZTdmODViZTA0OWYzNzgyY2E5NWYzZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commit/9afae0f1a04b5bd73fb7bc1b6541f7c7538e2c05","sha":"9afae0f1a04b5bd73fb7bc1b6541f7c7538e2c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commits/9afae0f1a04b5bd73fb7bc1b6541f7c7538e2c05"}],"sha":"c27424116e728f14ae7f85be049f3782ca95f3ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commits/c27424116e728f14ae7f85be049f3782ca95f3ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3136108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper","id":3136108,"login":"aSilentSniper","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzYxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commits/9afae0f1a04b5bd73fb7bc1b6541f7c7538e2c05/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:28:44Z","email":"christian.lerch01@t-online.de","name":"Christian Lerch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:28:44Z","email":"christian.lerch01@t-online.de","name":"Christian Lerch"},"message":"Fix empty station search hit and explain how the search matches\n\nA search without a match answered with an empty <stations> element, which\ntoArray() turned into one entry with empty name and EVA, so the admin list\nshowed a blank row with an \"add\" button instead of \"no results\". Empty XML\nelements now count as no data and entries without an EVA are dropped.\n\nThe IRIS station search matches the beginning of the station name (or the EVA\nnumber / DS100 code), has no wildcards and returned a single station in every\ntest, so \"Pferdemarkt\" finds nothing while \"Langenhagen Pferdemarkt\" does.\nThe admin component now says so, and its no-result message asks for a more\ncomplete name. The READMEs and the JSDoc describe the real behaviour, and the\ninvented two-station Karlsruhe example is replaced by a real API response.\n\nAdds tests for parsing a hit, an empty response and empty plan/change\nresponses; the admin bundle is rebuilt.","tree":{"sha":"3b8b331a3899bdd59b5eae0764967b078cc24f44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/git/trees/3b8b331a3899bdd59b5eae0764967b078cc24f44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/git/commits/9afae0f1a04b5bd73fb7bc1b6541f7c7538e2c05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3136108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper","id":3136108,"login":"aSilentSniper","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzYxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commit/9afae0f1a04b5bd73fb7bc1b6541f7c7538e2c05","node_id":"C_kwDOUNbFfdoAKDlhZmFlMGYxYTA0YjViZDczZmI3YmMxYjY1NDFmN2M3NTM4ZTJjMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commit/eb7b7b94f9ce870163fae140421a7e84c51a01e3","sha":"eb7b7b94f9ce870163fae140421a7e84c51a01e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commits/eb7b7b94f9ce870163fae140421a7e84c51a01e3"}],"sha":"9afae0f1a04b5bd73fb7bc1b6541f7c7538e2c05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commits/9afae0f1a04b5bd73fb7bc1b6541f7c7538e2c05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3136108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper","id":3136108,"login":"aSilentSniper","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzYxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/commits/eb7b7b94f9ce870163fae140421a7e84c51a01e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:24:11Z","email":"christian.lerch01@t-online.de","name":"Christian Lerch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:24:11Z","email":"christian.lerch01@t-online.de","name":"Christian Lerch"},"message":"Harden polling against a slow DB API, fix state roles, untrack .vscode\n\n- API requests time out after 15 s (AbortSignal) and network failures report\n  their real cause instead of \"fetch failed\"\n- pollAll() skips a run while the previous one is still running, so a hanging\n  API can no longer pile up parallel polls\n- timestamps use role value.time (numeric), text values use role text\n- the departure object name is only written when the line changes instead of\n  on every poll\n- .vscode is no longer tracked (editor convenience only)\n- tests for the request error handling, changelog entry for the next release","tree":{"sha":"9fbe379bdbef24338414b3a2586c248b3f9a348c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/git/trees/9fbe379bdbef24338414b3a2586c248b3f9a348c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aSilentSniper/ioBroker.dbtimetables/git/commits/eb7b7b94f9ce870163fae140421a7e84c51a01e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3136108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aSilentSniper","id":3136108,"login":"aSilentSniper","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzYxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aSilentSniper/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.gith