/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakaria-rab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zakaria-rab/glass-ui-app1/commits/4dd674fddfcee19f0f8e9891be3cb5c8f2ed9e35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T18:39:32Z","email":"zakaria.rab@overjet.ai","name":"Zakaria Rab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T18:39:32Z","email":"zakaria.rab@overjet.ai","name":"Zakaria Rab"},"message":"feat: report page views from each app to its own Vercel project\n\n<Analytics/> in the layout, so every app stamped from this template counts its\nown traffic without anyone adding it.\n\nPer-app rather than only in the shell because an app is deployed standalone at\nits own URL and also embedded in the portal''s iframe. Attribution only works if\neach app reports for itself; the shell counting iframe loads would tell you a\nroute was viewed, not which app.\n\nThe lockfile is updated in the same commit. Vercel installs with a frozen\nlockfile, so a package.json that names a dependency the lockfile does not know\nfails the build of every app made from this template.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c4e4f7b5721e7115a277e59bf65d09061fd89d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zakaria-rab/glass-ui-app1/git/trees/4c4e4f7b5721e7115a277e59bf65d09061fd89d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zakaria-rab/glass-ui-app1/git/commits/4dd674fddfcee19f0f8e9891be3cb5c8f2ed9e35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/323324583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakaria-rab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakaria-rab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakaria-rab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zakaria-rab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url