ssage":"Merge Dashboard into Launches (audit item 4, owner decision)\n\nGantry''s navigation puts the stat row at the top of Launches and keeps the old\nslug as a redirect. Launches now loads plan and attribution beside each\nlaunch''s detail (the same calls Dashboard made), shows the three stat tiles\nabove the filter and table, and carries signups and plan state as columns.\nThe dashboard view renders Launches, so the navigator''s actions and any old\nlink still land; the nav is Home / Launches / Runs / Settings; the logo links\nto Home as the spec says; the palette and the landing''s console link point at\nLaunches. pages/dashboard.tsx is deleted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"baf00b550fc01f6289354fe33ad3c5488c646c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/git/trees/baf00b550fc01f6289354fe33ad3c5488c646c3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/git/commits/91daaf378a343a6858e18662dc43a249558c9d77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80318074?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashidharbabu","id":80318074,"login":"shashidharbabu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzE4MDc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com