hashidharbabu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T23:16:23Z","email":"shashidharbabu.p19@gmail.com","name":"shashidharbabu"},"message":"Gantry finish: ambient field, thread mark, optical centre, phone layout, portals\n\nAudit items 1, 2, 3, 5 and 6. The ambient field returns on the Home empty\nstate, soft variant, radially masked, watching #lk-root for theme changes; it\nis gone once a conversation starts. Home replaces min-h-screen with min-h-dvh.\nEvery ad hoc z-index is gone: dialog layers use the z tokens upstream and the\nthree app cases rely on paint order instead. The thread is drawn by the app so\nthe Gantry mark sits beside each navigator turn, with the pending dots and the\ncapped reveal; the recent-launches card fills the space above the composer,\nwhich now sits at 40% of the section.\n\nRunning the checklist at phone width surfaced three more fixes: portals\nescaped .lk-root and rendered unstyled (upstream PortalContainerProvider, app\nprovides #lk-root); the phone top bar wrapped over the content (56px bar with a\nleft sheet; the gantry becomes a pill strip above the stage title); and sideways\nscroll from stretching grid tracks, an unscrollable Segmented, and sr-only\nlabels escaping the table frame. Logged as K9 to K11.\n\nVerified: typecheck 0, build ok, drive clean at 1440 and 390 in both themes,\nno screen scrolls sideways, zero page errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d7bf79502167a21e786b1478410c50a5293726f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/git/trees/7d7bf79502167a21e786b1478410c50a5293726f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/git/commits/cc7690aa1ff931b7ab5cfb12692b29ba8362c706","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80318074?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/events{/p