6VXNlcjgwMzE4MDc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/commits/2dfbe516cc104333f46cb760f90e2fa482568226/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T21:16:22Z","email":"shashidharbabu.p19@gmail.com","name":"shashidharbabu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T21:16:22Z","email":"shashidharbabu.p19@gmail.com","name":"shashidharbabu"},"message":"Home: let the landing break the fold; document the local loop\n\nThe chat stopped exactly at the viewport edge, so nothing hinted the landing\npage was below it and the hand-off to a full-bleed photograph was a hard cut.\nThe empty state now stops 5rem short and the hero fades up out of the canvas,\nso 79px of the launch pad shows above the fold. Gantry bans scroll cues\n(checklist.md, patterns/landing.md), so the composition carries the signal\ninstead of a label.\n\nAlso updates drive.flow.mjs for two labels the redesign changed (Analyze my app,\nApprove profile) which had silently broken the end-to-end drive, and adds\ndocs/LOCAL-DEV.md describing the loop that already exists: app on localhost:3400,\npipelines on staging under the same org as deploys, and the promotion steps.\n\nVerified: fresh-launch drive FLOW_DONE, 0 page errors, understand 107s,\napprove auto-advanced, targets 14 venues with 0 listings in the top five.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0724b0c9aa59b9c5bdddd9faa2020cea8ba53e1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shas