e real app URL for display, copy and share\n- Targets: gateTargets (repo files out, listings sink, impact capped, ranks\n  renumbered), targets_meta report; pipe: ICP watering holes, ranking\n  guardrails, awesome-lists only with a PR process; id rotated\n- Signals: QUERY STRATEGY in the pipe (open web first, Reddit broadly, niche\n  subreddits last), PAIN_HINTS in the question, THREAD_PAT accepts X, LinkedIn,\n  dev.to, Indie Hackers, Quora; id rotated\n- Store pipes'' unused LLM node on Claude; lk_store id pinned (never rotate)\n- Dash glue fixed in Targets and Social Launch lead text\n- The extension owns <root>/launchkit/ (app slug): sources moved to\n  launchkit-src/, /launchkit/ ignored, generators/tests/docs repointed,\n  deploy-app warns when tracked files vanish\n- Tests 60/60 (targets gate, signals goldens ignore PAIN_HINTS); docs J1-J8, H6-H7\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb076cbdad836ac0d74b2e1c1964722d5306d8f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/git/trees/bb076cbdad836ac0d74b2e1c1964722d5306d8f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/git/commits/1f2479d33304fefd1580ac1a62244d0ff14abde0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80318074?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shashidharbabu","id":80318074,"login":"shashidharbabu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzE4MDc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/received_events","r