ashidharbabu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shashidharbabu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/commits/dcdd09af8c72cfc27769afc0a0ba98b6f1a94234/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T22:48:09Z","email":"shashidharbabu.p19@gmail.com","name":"shashidharbabu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T22:48:09Z","email":"shashidharbabu.p19@gmail.com","name":"shashidharbabu"},"message":"Team workspaces: RocketRide teams, shared snapshot store, invites, switcher\n\n- Workspace = a RocketRide team; Personal keeps the per-user appState\n- Team workspace = one versioned row (whole store snapshot) in the store\n  pipe''s SQL node: optimistic writes, 30 s version polling, remount on change\n- WorkspaceProvider + top-bar switcher + Settings card (org, teams, members,\n  invite with team assignment, create team, one-click store check)\n- New launches carry workspace_id; the active choice is saved per user\n- Store calls carry 45 s timeouts so the UI always answers\n- domain/workspace-sql.ts pure builders with node tests (58/58)\n- Drive: launchkit/frontend/drive.workspace.mjs (WS_OK on the preview:\n  directory works, store check and team switch fail cleanly on an API key)\n- Docs: issues log I1-I4, test checklist, launch plan 1e\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65cdb4c0c05f26e74939b80d88c02fff097469be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/git/trees/65cdb4c0c05f26e74939b80d88c02fff097469be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shashidharbabu/launchkit/git/commits/dcdd09af8c72cfc27769af