ith\n  updated Pinned version), never silent code deviations.\n\nImpact: affects every project that synthesizes the root base. Regenerate with\nsetup-engineering to adopt; valid project exceptions are preserved.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d02045e37678295afd879848ea7d262702fc8e80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/vtex-cx-engineering-constitutions/git/trees/d02045e37678295afd879848ea7d262702fc8e80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/weni-ai/vtex-cx-engineering-constitutions/git/commits/72e1c38a13ea078a6ca3434fc7119a38d12bf917","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49874732?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sandro-Meireles","id":49874732,"login":"Sandro-Meireles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODc0NzMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sandro-Meireles","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/weni-ai/vtex-cx-engineering-constitutions/commit/72e1c38a13ea078a6ca3434fc7119a38d12bf917","node_id":"C_kwDOUNf169oAKDcyZTFjMzhhMTNlYTA3OGE2Y2EzNDM0ZmM3MTE5YTM4ZDEyYmY5MTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/weni-ai/vtex-cx-engineering-const