nt.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/7833d7df37f596708fe66f07062da8373a79d804/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:11:31Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:11:31Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"плани: факти про Binance — за документацією binance-spot\n\nЗвірено з документацією API споту Binance на 08.10.2026; п''ять тверджень у планах React і NestJS вона не\nпідтверджувала:\n\n- 24 години життя з''єднання документація називає для `stream.binance.com`; про `data-stream.binance.vision` окремо не\n  сказано — плани тепер так і пишуть і радять розраховувати на те саме;\n- розрив і бан прив''язані до ліміту 5 повідомлень на секунду («адресу, яку розривають раз у раз, можуть\n  заблокувати»), а не до 300 з''єднань за 5 хвилин — що буває після них, документація не пише;\n- потік `@kline_1m` шле свічку кожні 2 секунди, а не «кожні кілька секунд»;\n- для свічок `limit` — щонайбільше 1000; мовчазне обрізання до 5000 стосується книги заявок, тож пастка дня К1 тепер\n  про `limit` понад 1000 і блокування адреси (418) після ігнорованих 429;\n- про CORS у документації нічого немає — замість «CORS відкритий» план радить перевірити запит REST із браузера\n  першого ж дня.","tree":{"sha":"14b5d80260cb1ade1f51ea3d541cf9465eab095e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/14b5d80260cb1ade1f51ea3d541cf9465eab095e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/7833d7df37f596708fe66f07062da8373a79d804","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/7833d7df37f596708fe66f07062da8373a79d804","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDc4MzNkN2RmMzdmNTk2NzA4ZmU2NmYwNzA2MmRhODM3M2E3OWQ4MDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/a66882aba0189f536f7a749d2ead2f8b5fa5aa79","sha":"a66882aba0189f536f7a749d2ead2f8b5fa5aa79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/a66882aba0189f536f7a749d2ead2f8b5fa5aa79"}],"sha":"7833d7df37f596708fe66f07062da8373a79d804","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/7833d7df37f596708fe66f07062da8373a79d804"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/a66882aba0189f536f7a749d2ead2f8b5fa5aa79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:50:19Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:50:19Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"плани: API споту Binance у примірнику binance-spot\n\nРинкові дані Binance тепер мають примірник `binance-spot`: API споту перенесено до «Є примірник» у планах React і\nNestJS (Kraken, хостинги й Oracle Cloud лишаються в «ще немає»), а «документація Binance … (поза корпусом)» замінено\nточними назвами документів і розділів — `WebSocket Streams for Binance` («General WSS information», «WebSocket\nLimits», «Diff. Depth Stream», «How to manage a local order book correctly»), `Public Rest API for Binance`\n(«Kline/Candlestick data», «IP Limits»), `Market Data Only URLs`.\n\nСторінки дописано в «Читати» тих днів, де Binance — тема: React Ф3 (вступ блоку живих цін, дні 6–8) і факультатив\n«крипта» К1–К3; NestJS Ф7 (вступ, день 5) і факультатив К1. Рядки «Сервери MCP» днів і фаз перераховано; карта —\nтак само.","tree":{"sha":"3c413c800d28c6c9384ac9826cac9bd1b38b4c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/3c413c800d28c6c9384ac9826cac9bd1b38b4c4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/a66882aba0189f536f7a749d2ead2f8b5fa5aa79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/a66882aba0189f536f7a749d2ead2f8b5fa5aa79","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKGE2Njg4MmFiYTAxODlmNTM2ZjdhNzQ5ZDJlYWQyZjhiNWZhNWFhNzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/548c6599aee40f118fb2a4ee15d2a1f453c7ba4a","sha":"548c6599aee40f118fb2a4ee15d2a1f453c7ba4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/548c6599aee40f118fb2a4ee15d2a1f453c7ba4a"}],"sha":"a66882aba0189f536f7a749d2ead2f8b5fa5aa79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/a66882aba0189f536f7a749d2ead2f8b5fa5aa79"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/548c6599aee40f118fb2a4ee15d2a1f453c7ba4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:44:31Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:44:31Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"README: примірник binance-spot","tree":{"sha":"b8b20f07ff94b431bd0aca21fbaf20d7bf39b895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/b8b20f07ff94b431bd0aca21fbaf20d7bf39b895"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/548c6599aee40f118fb2a4ee15d2a1f453c7ba4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/548c6599aee40f118fb2a4ee15d2a1f453c7ba4a","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDU0OGM2NTk5YWVlNDBmMTE4ZmIyYTRlZTE1ZDJhMWY0NTNjN2JhNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/b3a2a243c5fcae705122e8a53baf4794e3d5d8b4","sha":"b3a2a243c5fcae705122e8a53baf4794e3d5d8b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/b3a2a243c5fcae705122e8a53baf4794e3d5d8b4"}],"sha":"548c6599aee40f118fb2a4ee15d2a1f453c7ba4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/548c6599aee40f118fb2a4ee15d2a1f453c7ba4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/b3a2a243c5fcae705122e8a53baf4794e3d5d8b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:35:53Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:35:53Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"binance-spot: примірник API споту Binance\n\nСорок перший примірник — документація API споту Binance англійською, з офіційного репозиторію\n`binance/binance-spot-api-docs` (гілка `master`):\n\n- REST API (`/api/v3`), WebSocket API, потоки ринкових даних і потік даних користувача, коди помилок, фільтри,\n  переліки значень, коротка довідка про потоки SBE і 14 довідок FAQ — серед них адреси лише для ринкових даних\n  (`data-api.binance.vision`, `data-stream.binance.vision`), ключі API, STP, SOR, глосарій;\n- журнал змін API споту (144 записи за датами від 14.01.2018) і журнал змін тестової мережі. Решта документації\n  тестової мережі, `fix-api.md`, схеми SBE, китайські переклади й демо-режим не беруться.\n\nВерсій у документації немає: вона описує API як він є зараз, фільтр `version` вимкнено. 24 документи, 1 042\nфрагменти, порт 8801, посилання — на файли на GitHub. Замір: «як модель» 10 із 10, своїми словами 7 із 10 з\n`max_per_doc: 1` (без поля — 5): документація довідникова, і питання описом, а не назвами ендпойнтів, у ній\nпромахуються. Корпус в архіві від самого початку.","tree":{"sha":"b79be86c0fa1a5439611d332f08630b73571afb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/b79be86c0fa1a5439611d332f08630b73571afb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/b3a2a243c5fcae705122e8a53baf4794e3d5d8b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/b3a2a243c5fcae705122e8a53baf4794e3d5d8b4","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKGIzYTJhMjQzYzVmY2FlNzA1MTIyZThhNTNiYWY0Nzk0ZTNkNWQ4YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/27700fc2e2592e2c15047b76f4f5ec9dfcf5352c","sha":"27700fc2e2592e2c15047b76f4f5ec9dfcf5352c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/27700fc2e2592e2c15047b76f4f5ec9dfcf5352c"}],"sha":"b3a2a243c5fcae705122e8a53baf4794e3d5d8b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/b3a2a243c5fcae705122e8a53baf4794e3d5d8b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/27700fc2e2592e2c15047b76f4f5ec9dfcf5352c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:39:21Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:39:21Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"читачі: mdfile — зміст doctoc і огорожа коду в пункті списку\n\nДля примірника binance-spot; без нових полів читач працює як раніше.\n\n- `cut_doctoc: true` прибирає зміст, який згенерував doctoc, — блок між «<!-- START doctoc» і «<!-- END doctoc -->».\n  У документації API споту Binance він перелічує кожен розділ файла, і головний фрагмент документа відгукувався б у\n  пошуку на назву будь-якого ендпойнта.\n- `list_fences: true` знімає маркер пункту списку перед огорожею коду («  * ```json» → «  ```json»). Таку відкривну\n  огорожу `markdown_body` не впізнає, закривну бере за відкривну, і в журналі змін Binance понад вісімдесят записів\n  злипалися в один фрагмент на 53 тисячі символів.","tree":{"sha":"e512d2fb836d89ff50f4ca8866a92e905794120d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/e512d2fb836d89ff50f4ca8866a92e905794120d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/27700fc2e2592e2c15047b76f4f5ec9dfcf5352c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/27700fc2e2592e2c15047b76f4f5ec9dfcf5352c","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDI3NzAwZmMyZTI1OTJlMmMxNTA0N2I3NmY0ZjVlYzlkZmNmNTM1MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/4dbf75a38cf6e890f402b5d6b289127449567338","sha":"4dbf75a38cf6e890f402b5d6b289127449567338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/4dbf75a38cf6e890f402b5d6b289127449567338"}],"sha":"27700fc2e2592e2c15047b76f4f5ec9dfcf5352c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/27700fc2e2592e2c15047b76f4f5ec9dfcf5352c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/4dbf75a38cf6e890f402b5d6b289127449567338/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:52:19Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:52:45Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"плани: web.dev і web-vitals у примірнику webdev\n\nweb.dev і бібліотека web-vitals тепер мають примірник `webdev`: їх перенесено до «Є примірник» у планах React,\nNext.js і Astro, а «поза корпусом» про пороги INP і документацію web-vitals замінено точними назвами сторінок.\n\nСторінки web.dev дописано в «Читати» тих днів, де тема — його предмет: метрики й пороги (React Ф2 Д5, Ф5 Д3;\nNext.js Ф1 Д14, Ф7 Д9–10; Astro Ф5 Д4), зображення, шрифти й пріоритети завантаження (React Ф5 Д4; Next.js Ф1 Д11;\nAstro Ф2 Д6–7), HTTP-кеш (React Ф5 Д6, Astro Ф0 Д4), доступність і форми (React Ф3 Д10, Д15; Next.js Ф4 Д6, Ф5 Д4;\nAstro Ф5 Д8), PWA (Next.js Ф5 Д7), рендеринг і DOM (React Ф0 Д8, Ф2 Д7, Ф3 Д8). Рядки «Сервери MCP» днів і фаз\nперераховано; карта — так само.","tree":{"sha":"94b53b4c0dbbada62445f360e8b70fa89d45a7c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/94b53b4c0dbbada62445f360e8b70fa89d45a7c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/4dbf75a38cf6e890f402b5d6b289127449567338","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/4dbf75a38cf6e890f402b5d6b289127449567338","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDRkYmY3NWEzOGNmNmU4OTBmNDAyYjVkNmIyODkxMjc0NDk1NjczMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/af388b924fc35c5596925c10f766d3cc0778d065","sha":"af388b924fc35c5596925c10f766d3cc0778d065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/af388b924fc35c5596925c10f766d3cc0778d065"}],"sha":"4dbf75a38cf6e890f402b5d6b289127449567338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/4dbf75a38cf6e890f402b5d6b289127449567338"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/af388b924fc35c5596925c10f766d3cc0778d065/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:39:24Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:39:24Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"README: примірник webdev\n\nРозділ про web.dev і web-vitals: що в корпусі, порт, версії, новий читач devsite-md.","tree":{"sha":"bdc7ccc3c260284bab1a19f092c715706b483829","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/bdc7ccc3c260284bab1a19f092c715706b483829"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/af388b924fc35c5596925c10f766d3cc0778d065","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/af388b924fc35c5596925c10f766d3cc0778d065","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKGFmMzg4YjkyNGZjMzVjNTU5NjkyNWMxMGY3NjZkM2NjMDc3OGQwNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/d37171bce0be3c972a1cef98348031f5943adfd0","sha":"d37171bce0be3c972a1cef98348031f5943adfd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/d37171bce0be3c972a1cef98348031f5943adfd0"}],"sha":"af388b924fc35c5596925c10f766d3cc0778d065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/af388b924fc35c5596925c10f766d3cc0778d065"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/d37171bce0be3c972a1cef98348031f5943adfd0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:39:05Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:39:05Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"webdev: примірник web.dev і web-vitals\n\nСороковий примірник — як робити сайти швидкими, доступними й надійними, англійською:\n\n- web.dev — курси Learn (CSS, JavaScript, HTML, Accessibility, Forms, Images, Performance, PWA, Design, Testing,\n  Privacy, AI), 840 статей — серед них метрики Core Web Vitals із порогами й тим, як їх обрано, — і блог. Версій у\n  сайту немає, дата публікації й оновлення стоїть у тексті. Відео, кейси, розсилка й окремі сторінки тестів курсів\n  не беруться;\n- `web-vitals` — README кожного стабільного випуску 0.1.0–6.2.3 (56 випусків, 35 різних текстів; бети, rc і\n  експериментальні збірки — ні), журнал змін, документ на випуск, і настанови з переходу на v4, v5 і v6.\n\n1 407 документів, 16 148 фрагментів, порт 8800. Замір: своїми словами 9 із 10, «як модель» 10 із 10 — з цілями, до\nяких дописано рівноцінні сторінки (з першими, вужчими — 5 і 9); сітка `max_per_doc` × `fusion_depth` найкраще дала\nбез обох полів. Корпус в архіві від самого початку.","tree":{"sha":"083ce42e4f429438bba25d1b9233634ed316348e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/083ce42e4f429438bba25d1b9233634ed316348e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/d37171bce0be3c972a1cef98348031f5943adfd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/d37171bce0be3c972a1cef98348031f5943adfd0","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKGQzNzE3MWJjZTBiZTNjOTcyYTFjZWY5ODM0ODAzMWY1OTQzYWRmZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/026ba99cd21117864148715cb4126dfdf8fbd7e8","sha":"026ba99cd21117864148715cb4126dfdf8fbd7e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/026ba99cd21117864148715cb4126dfdf8fbd7e8"}],"sha":"d37171bce0be3c972a1cef98348031f5943adfd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/d37171bce0be3c972a1cef98348031f5943adfd0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/026ba99cd21117864148715cb4126dfdf8fbd7e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:38:35Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:38:35Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"читачі: web.dev (DevSite), стиснуті відповіді, рівень заголовка журналу змін\n\nДля примірника webdev; без нових полів читачі й мережа працюють як раніше.\n\n- `devsite-md` — сайт на Google DevSite (web.dev), що віддає сторінку markdown-ом за адресою з «.md.txt». Перелік —\n  із сайтмапа (індекс розгортається в частини, переклади `?hl=…` відкидаються), бо сторінки «Articles» і «Blog»\n  складають перелік скриптом. Назви в markdown статей і глав немає — береться з `<title>` HTML; глава курсу\n  підписується назвою курсу з його сторінки-змісту («Learn CSS: Box Model»), запис блогу — «Blog: …» з датою.\n  Вирізаються рядки авторів, банер розсилки, кнопки згортання, тести «Test your knowledge» і «Check your\n  understanding» — у них запитання й відповіді злиті в суцільні рядки.\n- `net.fetch(…, gzip=True)` просить стиснуту відповідь і розпаковує її під окремою стелею (120 МБ): частини\n  сайтмапа web.dev без цього відповідають 500, а розпаковані важать 78 і 81 МБ. `Ctx` передає поле лише тоді, коли\n  його попросили, тож виклик для решти той самий.\n- `changelog-v` — необов''язкове поле `heading`: `web-vitals` пише версії під «### v6.2.0».","tree":{"sha":"fbe4cbf0a02bc184dab878f77552d072c6b9f3fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/fbe4cbf0a02bc184dab878f77552d072c6b9f3fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/026ba99cd21117864148715cb4126dfdf8fbd7e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/026ba99cd21117864148715cb4126dfdf8fbd7e8","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDAyNmJhOTljZDIxMTE3ODY0MTQ4NzE1Y2I0MTI2ZGZkZjhmYmQ3ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/5d614622f016fcc08cf9b4eb3f3bc24e0b0d7f0b","sha":"5d614622f016fcc08cf9b4eb3f3bc24e0b0d7f0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/5d614622f016fcc08cf9b4eb3f3bc24e0b0d7f0b"}],"sha":"026ba99cd21117864148715cb4126dfdf8fbd7e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/026ba99cd21117864148715cb4126dfdf8fbd7e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/5d614622f016fcc08cf9b4eb3f3bc24e0b0d7f0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:28:25Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T01:28:25Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"плани: Base UI і React Aria в примірнику shadcn\n\n- React — у день доступності (фаза 3, день 15) поруч з `Accessibility` Radix Primitives стала `React Aria:\n  Accessibility`: бібліотека, що будує компоненти саме навколо доступності, показує, як фокус, клавіатуру й ARIA\n  тримають за вас.\n- React і Next.js — у списках «Є примірник» рядок shadcn тепер називає всі три бібліотеки примітивів: Radix UI, Base\n  UI, React Aria.\n\nІнших днів, де Base UI чи React Aria — сам предмет, плани не мають; карта навчання не змінюється — примірник той\nсамий.","tree":{"sha":"0362d9c516a0a5a666915b031eec5dda48925065","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/0362d9c516a0a5a666915b031eec5dda48925065"},"url":"https://api.gith