verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/2b9b954be6e7bf26eb4005818016a74d372fb267","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDJiOWI5NTRiZTZlN2JmMjZlYjQwMDU4MTgwMTZhNzRkMzcyZmIyNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/54bd7e12ff0c0b3e56d6e6834d1e18454f798731","sha":"54bd7e12ff0c0b3e56d6e6834d1e18454f798731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/54bd7e12ff0c0b3e56d6e6834d1e18454f798731"}],"sha":"2b9b954be6e7bf26eb4005818016a74d372fb267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/2b9b954be6e7bf26eb4005818016a74d372fb267"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/54bd7e12ff0c0b3e56d6e6834d1e18454f798731/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:40:53Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:40:53Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"nginx: примірник документації nginx\n\nТридцять восьмий примірник — nginx англійською, якомога повніше:\n\n- nginx.org — поточна документація (мітка «1.31») і знімок на мить випуску кожної стабільної гілки 1.0–1.30: модулі\n  http, stream і mail з кожною директивою, njs, посібники, FAQ. Тегів версій сайт не має, тож знімок — коміт\n  репозиторію `nginx/nginx.org` на мить випуску X.Y.0; історія в git починається в серпні 2011, тож у «1.0» лише 12\n  сторінок англійською;\n- журнали змін — документ на кожен випуск 0.1.0–1.31.6, разом із виправленнями стабільних гілок;\n- docs.nginx.com — NGINX Admin Guide, NGINX Ingress Controller (поточний і LTS, одна родина) і NGINX Gateway\n  Fabric;\n- ingress-nginx спільноти Kubernetes — кожна мінорна 0.34–1.15 (проєкт закрито в березні 2026).\n\n2 181 документ, 11 390 фрагментів, порт 8798. Замір: своїми словами 8 із 10, «як модель» 10 із 10; сітка\n`max_per_doc` × `fusion_depth` найкраще з «як модель» 10 дала без обох полів. Корпус в архіві від самого початку.","tree":{"sha":"17956671f840a04e52115e1071f2c2497d0aa0a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/17956671f840a04e52115e1071f2c2497d0aa0a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/54bd7e12ff0c0b3e56d6e6834d1e18454f798731","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/54bd7e12ff0c0b3e56d6e6834d1e18454f798731","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDU0YmQ3ZTEyZmYwYzBiM2U1NmQ2ZTY4MzRkMWUxODQ1NGY3OTg3MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/8085f92a917d50a4d0cf59901791fd47030c9344","sha":"8085f92a917d50a4d0cf59901791fd47030c9344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/8085f92a917d50a4d0cf59901791fd47030c9344"}],"sha":"54bd7e12ff0c0b3e56d6e6834d1e18454f798731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/54bd7e12ff0c0b3e56d6e6834d1e18454f798731"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/8085f92a917d50a4d0cf59901791fd47030c9344/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:40:15Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:40:15Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"читачі: XML nginx.org, вставки Hugo docs.nginx.com і журнал змін nginx\n\nДва нові необов''язкові поля `ghdocs-history` і новий читач — для документації nginx:\n\n- `nginx_xml` — сторінки nginx.org пишуться власним словником XML (модуль, розділи, директиви), а не markdown.\n  Перед розбором вони стають markdown так, як їх показує сайт: «### proxy_pass», під нею рядки «Syntax:»,\n  «Default:», «Context:» і «This directive appeared in version …», приклади — блоками коду, вбудовані `literal`,\n  `var` і `path` — кодом. Сутності з DTD (`&nbsp;`, `&mdash;`) підставляються до розбору: без цього файл не\n  читався б зовсім.\n- `hugo` — сторінки docs.nginx.com збирає Hugo, і чимала частина тексту стоїть у вставках: `include` спільних\n  шматків (кроки встановлення, застереження), `ghcode` прикладів з інших репозиторіїв, короткі коди з назвою чи\n  номером версії продукту. Вставки розгортаються з файлів того самого репозиторію, виноски `call-out` стають\n  підписом «Note:» / «Important:», вкладки й розгортки — підписом зі своєю назвою. Вставка поза білим списком чи\n  така, що не прочиталася, просто випадає.\n- `nginx-changes` — журнал змін nginx простим текстом: кожен випуск («Changes with nginx 1.27.3  26 Nov 2024»)\n  стає окремим документом із версією-номером, записи «*) Feature: …» — пунктами. Виправлення стабільних гілок є\n  лише в журналі своєї гілки, тож читач бере кілька файлів, а випуск, що є в кількох, — один раз.\n\nБез нових полів `ghdocs-history` працює як раніше.","tree":{"sha":"8885d17ef0b492bc3b2083f636f0ad3e1e0db158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/8885d17ef0b492bc3b2083f636f0ad3e1e0db158"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/8085f92a917d50a4d0cf59901791fd47030c9344","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/8085f92a917d50a4d0cf59901791fd47030c9344","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDgwODVmOTJhOTE3ZDUwYTRkMGNmNTk5MDE3OTFmZDQ3MDMwYzkzNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/fcb5e3128af9b6780f2ce40d9536c23bcfec89c1","sha":"fcb5e3128af9b6780f2ce40d9536c23bcfec89c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/fcb5e3128af9b6780f2ce40d9536c23bcfec89c1"}],"sha":"8085f92a917d50a4d0cf59901791fd47030c9344","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/8085f92a917d50a4d0cf59901791fd47030c9344"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/fcb5e3128af9b6780f2ce40d9536c23bcfec89c1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:10:15Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:10:15Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"плани: примірник nodejs у плані Astro\n\nПлан Astro досі вважав Node.js таким, що примірника не має. Тепер `nodejs` стоїть у «Є примірник», а день 6\nфази 0 «Node та інструменти» читає звідти `scripts`, `npm-run-script` і `How to read environment variables from\nNode.js`.","tree":{"sha":"55cfc3e9be3e839874884fbbc44f79ecb91d99c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/55cfc3e9be3e839874884fbbc44f79ecb91d99c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/fcb5e3128af9b6780f2ce40d9536c23bcfec89c1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/fcb5e3128af9b6780f2ce40d9536c23bcfec89c1","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKGZjYjVlMzEyOGFmOWI2NzgwZjJjZTQwZDk1MzZjMjNiY2ZlYzg5YzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/3b79eda23ae53441b54f510304342832ffa89da3","sha":"3b79eda23ae53441b54f510304342832ffa89da3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/3b79eda23ae53441b54f510304342832ffa89da3"}],"sha":"fcb5e3128af9b6780f2ce40d9536c23bcfec89c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/fcb5e3128af9b6780f2ce40d9536c23bcfec89c1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/3b79eda23ae53441b54f510304342832ffa89da3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:53:36Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:53:36Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"примірники: родини джерел-версій\n\nЧотирнадцять примірників оголошують у `families` джерела, що є редакціями тих самих сторінок: сайти tailwind v0–v4,\nMSW 1/2/3, CLI npm 6–12, man-pages і Ubuntu man, версії astro, nestjs, react, next-auth, Clerk Core 1–3, wasm core і\nJS API, API react-router 7/8, приклади tanstack-query v0–v5, Gateway API у двох форматах, RFC 6265 і 6265bis. Жоден\nчлен родини не ділить ключів із джерелами поза нею. Журнали змін react-router (сторінка релізів і CHANGELOG пакета)\nнавмисно лишено окремими: тексти доповнюють одне одного.\n\n`quality` і `smoke` шістнадцяти примірників зі спільними ключами — ті самі до кожного запиту.","tree":{"sha":"5f694065d96be3cc9d0a942d0f117923da07b8aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/5f694065d96be3cc9d0a942d0f117923da07b8aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/3b79eda23ae53441b54f510304342832ffa89da3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/3b79eda23ae53441b54f510304342832ffa89da3","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKDNiNzllZGEyM2FlNTM0NDFiNTRmNTEwMzA0MzQyODMyZmZhODlkYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/b7fe873a06d8d83b769f39b3f573c348ff650e2f","sha":"b7fe873a06d8d83b769f39b3f573c348ff650e2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/b7fe873a06d8d83b769f39b3f573c348ff650e2f"}],"sha":"3b79eda23ae53441b54f510304342832ffa89da3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/3b79eda23ae53441b54f510304342832ffa89da3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commits/b7fe873a06d8d83b769f39b3f573c348ff650e2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:53:18Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T13:53:18Z","email":"gochualex@gmail.com","name":"Oleksandr Gochu"},"message":"пошук: родина джерела в ключі згортання видачі\n\nПошук згортав однакові розділи в одне місце за самим шляхом сторінки, і однаковий шлях різних продуктів ішов як повтор:\nжурнал змін svelte-query 6.1.39 ховав журнал svelte-query-devtools тієї ж версії, «2 Terminology» RFC 7515 — той\nсамий розділ RFC 7519, правило `jsx-quotes` ядра ESLint — однойменне правило плагіна react. Таких ключів знайшлося\n~309 у шести примірниках.\n\nТепер ключ згортання — родина джерела разом із розділом, а родина за замовчуванням — саме джерело. Джерела, що є\nредакціями тих самих сторінок (сайт кожної версії окремим джерелом), оголошують спільну родину в полі `families`\nconfig.json і згортаються, як і раніше. Злиття дослівно однакових текстів під час побудови корпусу не змінено. Файли,\nвектори й цілі `quality` від поля не залежать; `config.json` перевіряє, що кожне джерело — щонайбільше в одній\nродині. UPDATE.md: нове джерело-версію дописувати в родину; сироти прибирає `vectors`.","tree":{"sha":"198be41be23ee5ad121e3b12a1c3639c2130d68e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/trees/198be41be23ee5ad121e3b12a1c3639c2130d68e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/git/commits/b7fe873a06d8d83b769f39b3f573c348ff650e2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12134884?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlexGochu","id":12134884,"login":"AlexGochu","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTM0ODg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlexGochu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ZlyiUkra/docfactory/commit/b7fe873a06d8d83b769f39b3f573c348ff650e2f","node_id":"C_kwDOUNyOMtoAKGI3ZmU4NzNhMDZkOGQ4M2I3NjlmMzliM2Y1NzNjMzQ4ZmY2NTBlMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"http