ttps://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/commits/0c787915365a2369f6d7ce1f60e6ecaff61d6dc4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:16:30Z","email":"ved.prakash@qualtechedge.com","name":"Ved Prakash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:16:30Z","email":"ved.prakash@qualtechedge.com","name":"Ved Prakash"},"message":"refactor(infra): split the portal into zoned next apps on shared packages\n\nOne repository, four apps served together as zones (shell, claims, loans,\nadmin) on twelve @imgc/* workspace packages. The shell owns sign-in, `/` and\n`/api/*`; each content zone owns its paths and serves its assets under\n`/<zone>-static`.\n\n- tooling/createNextConfig.ts: the one Next config every app calls\n- redirectTo() + /api/zone-redirect: redirects that cross zones\n- dev: sequential, warmed start-up and a front-door proxy (scripts/devFrontDoor.mjs)\n  that forwards the hot-reload socket, so zone pages become interactive\n- logout / exit-admin-context redirect with a relative Location\n- layer and exports checks (check:layers, check:exports)\n- docs: migration plan status and AGENTS.md monorepo rules\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"213cbdf412e20e3ee53995176ac69b8e0dc0194f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/git/trees/213cbdf412e20e3ee53995176ac69b8e0dc0194f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/git/commits/0c787915365a2