d-prakash-qualtech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ved-prakash-qualtech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/commits/4602e84670d6540032d0992dcedd9a04d14ba2c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T05:52:03Z","email":"ved.prakash@qualtechedge.com","name":"Ved Prakash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T05:52:03Z","email":"ved.prakash@qualtechedge.com","name":"Ved Prakash"},"message":"feat(common): document waivers and notification hierarchy\n\nA mandatory document the lender cannot supply is now asked to be waived\nfrom inside the Upload dialog; IMGC allows or declines it on the Decision\ntab, and a waived document counts as settled everywhere a claim asks\nwhether something is still outstanding. Both steps notify the side that\nhas to act.\n\nNotifications now address the stakeholder responsible for the next action\nand copy the rest, instead of mailing everyone as one list.\n\nAlso: Neon reads go through a version check before pulling the snapshot\n(the full read on every request was exhausting the transfer allowance),\ndraft uploads only count once Save Draft keeps them, and the Bulk Refund\nUpload screen is removed in favour of the per-claim button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d34cb5e360cf71075d7ac194c5b636b7c5cc5e07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/git/trees/d34cb5e360cf71075d7ac194c5b636b7c5cc5e07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/git/commits/4602e84670d6540032d0992dcedd9a04d14ba2c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_a