"https://api.github.com/users/shivangg8/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivangg8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivangg8/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivangg8","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/commits/72ebbd0293757e464a37cafa2ca798c608f13fa5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:29:55Z","email":"shivang.sharma@qualtechedge.com","name":"Shivang Sharma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T04:29:55Z","email":"shivang.sharma@qualtechedge.com","name":"Shivang Sharma"},"message":"feat(portal): align IMGC claim details UI and document grid layout\n\nThis commit includes the following changes:\n- Merges the Documents tab into the Query/Decision tab.\n- Adds a dedicated Status column to the IMGC document grid.\n- Replaces Accept/Reject buttons with compact icon buttons and reduces action column spacing.\n- Replaces document ''View'' button with file name hyperlink.\n- Renames ''Approved'' document status to ''Accepted''.\n- Renames ''Processing outcome'' panel to ''Query Management''.\n- Aligns IMGC Loan Details to exactly match Lender Track Claim Loan Details.\n- Separates IMGC-specific fields (Lender, Bucket, Claim Status) into a new Claim Details header panel and removes the ''Stage'' field.","tree":{"sha":"a646c2292de52e2d804bb7eb5c24c48079663546","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/git/trees/a646c2292de52e2d804bb7eb5c24c48079663546"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ved-prakash-qualtech/imgc/git/commits/72ebbd0293757e464a37cafa2ca798c608f13fa5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/297164384?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivangg8/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.gith