ase-script` write\npackage.json with two. So every version bump produced a file the lint step\nrefuses, and since that step runs before the deploy job, both 0.0.4 and\n0.0.5 were tagged and never published.\n\nThe ignore list already excludes package-lock.json and the translations\nfor the same reason -- written by other tooling -- so package.json joins\nthem rather than being reformatted after every release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fe8f107f3741447e46f93f6d4658a3f6bdd51b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/git/trees/8fe8f107f3741447e46f93f6d4658a3f6bdd51b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/git/commits/a500db2d2000d4d5ad126a399bf4c63a319daddb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commit/a500db2d2000d4d5ad126a399bf4c63a319daddb","node_id":"C_kw