criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commit/b59f6d0316ea924de9bf83a3dbd91beb7594758a","node_id":"C_kwDOUN-dLNoAKGI1OWY2ZDAzMTZlYTkyNGRlOWJmODNhM2RiZDkxYmViNzU5NDc1OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commit/cc345b95a435d932ec2d3ecc769cae85baef7cd7","sha":"cc345b95a435d932ec2d3ecc769cae85baef7cd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commits/cc345b95a435d932ec2d3ecc769cae85baef7cd7"}],"sha":"b59f6d0316ea924de9bf83a3dbd91beb7594758a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commits/b59f6d0316ea924de9bf83a3dbd91beb7594758a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commits/cc345b95a435d932ec2d3ecc769cae85baef7cd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:35:40Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:35:40Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"ci: let the build install the frontend it builds\n\n`tsc: command not found`, on every leg of the matrix. The check action runs\n`npm ci` in the repository root and then `npm run build`, and the build is\n`cd src-admin && npm run build` -- a project of its own, with its own lock file,\nthat nothing had installed.\n\nThe build installs it now, which is what the adapter template does too: a build\nthat needs something brings it along rather than assuming somebody else did.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015McHmTR6q5oWNfBsvtkcui","tree":{"sha":"7f6d95c4ccf4c7f1a5a8f3e4571d45377c137332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/git/trees/7f6d95c4ccf4c7f1a5a8f3e4571d45377c137332"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/git/commits/cc345b95a435d932ec2d3ecc769cae85baef7cd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commit/cc345b95a435d932ec2d3ecc769cae85baef7cd7","node_id":"C_kwDOUN-dLNoAKGNjMzQ1Yjk1YTQzNWQ5MzJlYzJkM2VjYzc2OWNhZTg1YmFlZjdjZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commit/ad112753b51ab3f49a0f51cb8a1768c4f9e8167a","sha":"ad112753b51ab3f49a0f51cb8a1768c4f9e8167a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commits/ad112753b51ab3f49a0f51cb8a1768c4f9e8167a"}],"sha":"cc345b95a435d932ec2d3ecc769cae85baef7cd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commits/cc345b95a435d932ec2d3ecc769cae85baef7cd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/commits/ad112753b51ab3f49a0f51cb8a1768c4f9e8167a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:27:22Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T17:28:15Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"ci: give the workflow the lint script it calls, and match the two versions\n\nThree things kept every run red, none of them the tests themselves.\n\n**`npm run lint` did not exist.** The workflow asks for `lint: true`, which makes\nthe check action run exactly that, and this repo has no eslint configuration\nanywhere -- what it does enforce is prettier, through `format:check`. So `lint`\nis that check now, and the 13 files that had drifted from it are formatted. The\nalternative was a workflow that claims to lint and finds nothing to call.\n\n**package.json said 0.0.2, io-package.json said 0.0.1.** The package test\ncompares them and fails, which is the whole point of it: the two are what admin\nand npm each read, and an adapter whose manifests disagree installs as one\nversion and reports another. The changelog has 0.0.2 with \"Added prettier\", so\nio-package.json is the one that lagged; it carries the version and a news entry\nfor it now.\n\n**The push trigger named \"master\".** This repo''s branch is `main`, so nothing was\never checked on a push -- only pull requests ran, which is why this only became\nvisible when dependabot opened some.\n\n`npm run lint` and `npm run test:package` -- the two commands the action runs --\npass here: 58 package tests, prettier clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015McHmTR6q5oWNfBsvtkcui","tree":{"sha":"fef9a81227e4247bc70693041384bbd6a530b6ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/git/trees/fef9a81227e4247bc70693041384bbd6a530b6ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.python/git/commits/ad112753b51ab3f49a0f51cb8a1768c4f9e8167a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","eve