U_kgDOD2Snag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/commits/94460321bdef26a197dcbc03f7b3d4643449b303/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:18:58Z","email":"tsalinas@talana.com","name":"Tamara Salinas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T19:18:58Z","email":"tsalinas@talana.com","name":"Tamara Salinas"},"message":"ci(workflows): configure Talana registry auth before install\n\n@talana/talanify-next is published only in Talana''s private Artifact\nRegistry, which does not allow anonymous access. Without this step,\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile fails with 401 before any job runs.\n\nThe step injects a _authToken read from the NPM_CONFIG_TALANA_TOKEN\nsecret into a per-runner ~/.npmrc. The same step runs in both the\n''checks'' and ''e2e'' jobs so neither blocks on auth.\n\nIf the secret is not set, the step is skipped (env.TALANA_TOKEN != '''' is\nfalse) and the existing failure is preserved — failing loud is correct\nin that case, not silently passing.","tree":{"sha":"88f5909d3724e558679de2b39e03811cf3dca392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/git/trees/88f5909d3724e558679de2b39e03811cf3dca392"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/git/commits/94460321bdef26a197dcbc03f7b3d4643449b303","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258254698?v=4","events_url":