/poc-monorepo-mf/commits/2c2ff20d0698f033204a9888e8c45b0f18a194e9"}],"sha":"a2c2a9b942fd0cb0ddd2dc6c33e3eb7d9bf6588c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/commits/a2c2a9b942fd0cb0ddd2dc6c33e3eb7d9bf6588c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258254698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tsalinasdev","id":258254698,"login":"tsalinasdev","node_id":"U_kgDOD2Snag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/commits/2c2ff20d0698f033204a9888e8c45b0f18a194e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T21:19:32Z","email":"tsalinas@talana.com","name":"Tamara Salinas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T21:19:32Z","email":"tsalinas@talana.com","name":"Tamara Salinas"},"message":"docs: align README to Screaming Architecture\n\nThe host''s shell moved into modules/ and the remotes'' Clean Architecture\nlayers (domain/application/infrastructure/presentation) were collapsed\ninto a Screaming-style modules/<feature>/{composables,services,models,views}\n+ modules/shared/ layout. This commit catches the documentation up with\nthat refactor:\n\n- README.md: every stale path is gone (src/config/, src/types/,\n  src/layouts/, src/views/, src/base/) and every Clean Architecture term\n  (Result<T>, Awilix, mappers, ports, use cases, Screen Mapper,\n  use*ViewModel, hexágono, NotFoundScreen, RemoteUnavailableScreen) is\n  replaced with the Screaming equivalent (composables, services,\n  models, views, RemoteUnavailableView, NotFoundView, módulos federados).\n- Estructura section rewritten to match the actual tree.\n- Colada confinado section rewritten for the new composable-only\n  contract: services transform API responses inline, composables wrap\n  the queries, no Result<>, no DomainException, no separate mappers.\n- docs/README.md: R5 explanation updated to reference the new\n  modules/shared/config/ duplication instead of the obsolete src/base/.\n- intro: stack now lists Screaming Architecture (Talana wiki link)\n  instead of Awilix + hexagonal-architecture skill.","tree":{"sha":"86bde980407b2433e76f76d4f2d6b60f4cd259f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/git/trees/86bde980407b2433e76f76d4f2d6b60f4cd259f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/git/commits/2c2ff20d0698f033204a9888e8c45b0f18a194e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258254698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tsalinasdev","id":258254698,"login":"tsalinasdev","node_id":"U_kgDOD2Snag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/repos","site_admin":fals