t":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T20:53:28Z","email":"tsalinas@talana.com","name":"Tamara Salinas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T20:53:28Z","email":"tsalinas@talana.com","name":"Tamara Salinas"},"message":"refactor(host): align shell to screaming architecture\n\nMove host shell into modules/ to match the Talana Screaming Architecture\nconvention (modules/<feature>/{components,composables,views} + shared/).\n\n- src/config/      -> src/modules/shared/config/   (env, colada)\n- src/types/       -> src/modules/shared/types/    (remotes.d.ts)\n- src/layouts/     -> src/modules/shell/components/composables/\n- src/views/       -> src/modules/shell/views/     (NotFound, RemoteUnavailable)\n\nTests mirror the new structure: __test__/layouts/ -> __test__/shell/{components,composables}/.\n\nNo Clean Architecture remnants: services keep business logic + API calls\ninline; no repositories, use-cases, ports or DI.","tree":{"sha":"5dae7da9c34d7de56e1aa6fa2cf114513fcf30a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/git/trees/5dae7da9c34d7de56e1aa6fa2cf114513fcf30a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/git/commits/ae3559b728a9cbb7e7b132267b2c5b4c03d3b6ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/258254698?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tsalinasdev","id":258254698,"login":"tsalinasdev","node_id":"U_kgDOD2Snag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsalinasdev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/commit/ae3559b728a9cbb7e7b132267b2c5b4c03d3b6ec","node_id":"C_kwDOUOWZhtoAKGFlMzU1OWI3MjhhOWNiYjdlN2IxMzIyNjdiMmM1YjRjMDNkM2I2ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/commit/6c118cf6dcc5d7c87a7d8607e6a262536b5901e0","sha":"6c118cf6dcc5d7c87a7d8607e6a262536b5901e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/commits/6c118cf6dcc5d7c87a7d8607e6a262536b5901e0"}],"sha":"ae3559b728a9cbb7e7b132267b2c5b4c03d3b6ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/commits/ae3559b728a9cbb7e7b132267b2c5b4c03d3b6ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255189404?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lquispejs","id":255189404,"login":"lquispejs","node_id":"U_kgDODzXhnA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/commits/6c118cf6dcc5d7c87a7d8607e6a262536b5901e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T19:41:47Z","email":"lquispe@talana.com","name":"lquispe"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T19:41:47Z","email":"lquispe@talana.com","name":"lquispe"},"message":"refactor: adopt screaming architecture and align MF bridge usage\n\nReplace the hexagonal layering (domain/application/infrastructure/use-cases,\nports, DI container, Result type) with the Talana Front module convention:\nmodules/<feature>/{views,components,composables,services,models,router}\nplus modules/shared, mirroring frontend-communications.\n\n- remotes: composables call plain service functions; API mapping, retry\n  and error normalization (ApiError/NotFoundError) live in\n  modules/shared/api/http.ts; tests move to src/__test__ as service and\n  composable specs\n- remotes: routes are basename-relative by contract; export-app feeds the\n  bridge a plain router (createRemoteAppComponent derives the basename\n  from the host''s matched route); awilix removed\n- host: layout becomes static chrome in App.vue, remote catch-alls are\n  top-level so the bridge derives each basename natively; router/views/\n  layouts follow the same convention\n- config: eslint boundaries rules dropped, vitest include and tsconfigs\n  updated, dev proxies set secure:false for the corporate TLS re-signing\n\nNo federated contract changed; type-check, unit tests, lint and builds\npass on all three apps.","tree":{"sha":"5e883993b0ffaab51ba153699d74b6f18d0a2d1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/git/trees/5e883993b0ffaab51ba153699d74b6f18d0a2d1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tsalinasdev/poc-monorepo-mf/git/commits/6c118cf6dcc5d7c87a7d8607e6a262536b5901e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255189404?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lquispejs/events{/priv