ggamer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldinggamer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldinggamer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goldinggamer/arbify/commits/70f244525fa8fe72579142261c8c5b5c11805c2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:24:45Z","email":"gagagarekt@gmail.com","name":"Goldinggamer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T16:24:45Z","email":"gagagarekt@gmail.com","name":"Goldinggamer"},"message":"Arbify: Arbitrage-Scanner über 16 deutsche Buchmacher\n\nErster Stand: React-Oberfläche, Scanner-Backend mit 16 Adaptern über vier\nTransportwege, acht Sportarten, Marktzuordnung auf kanonische Schlüssel,\nTelefonmeldung über ntfy/Pushover.\n\nZugangsdaten und der gespiegelte Filter liegen in .arbify-alerts.json und\nbleiben bewusst außerhalb des Repositories.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a0213e89ac1ab1dfa819377e966bf56a158019b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goldinggamer/arbify/git/trees/7a0213e89ac1ab1dfa819377e966bf56a158019b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Goldinggamer/arbify/git/commits/70f244525fa8fe72579142261c8c5b5c11805c2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73194598?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldinggamer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldinggamer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldinggamer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldinggamer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Goldinggamer","id":73194598,"login":"Goldinggamer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMTk0NTk4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldinggamer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Goldinggam