agent%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Code-Stride/anime/commits/76ede1c70c843a4847feaa6203029c2be7e8aecd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T19:21:04Z","email":"arena-ai-coding-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"arena-ai-coding-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T19:21:04Z","email":"arena-ai-coding-agent[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"arena-ai-coding-agent[bot]"},"message":"fix: restore GitHub Pages deploy via artifact flow\n\nThe Pages site is configured with build_type: workflow, which only serves\nartifacts uploaded by actions/deploy-pages and ignores a gh-pages branch.\nThe workflow had been switched to peaceiris/actions-gh-pages, so every\ndeploy ''succeeded'' while https://code-stride.github.io/anime/ served a\n404 ''There isn''t a GitHub Pages site here.''\n\nGo back to the official flow (configure-pages + upload-pages-artifact +\ndeploy-pages) and add enablement: true, which the README already claimed\nbut the workflow never had -- its absence is why the original\nactions/deploy-pages run failed and the site was switched to branch\npublishing in the first place.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4468f22bd41c9ca90dcd28152d4b804c834318c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Code-Stride/anime/git/trees/4468f22bd41c9ca90dcd28152d4b804c834318c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Code-Stride/anime/git/commits/76ede1c70c843a4847feaa6203029c2be7e8aecd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/4187077?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arena-ai-coding-agent%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arena-ai-coding-agent%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arena-ai-coding-agent%5Bbot%5D/followin