"html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","id":195638313,"login":"WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","node_id":"U_kgDOC6k0KQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/7c8110e0f93af7a73572275be0c944b80f95c155/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:40:58Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:40:58Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"message":"Generate sitemap.xml at build time instead of hand-maintaining it\n\nThe hand-maintained public/sitemap.xml had lastmod dates weeks stale\n(Sept 5-6) while pages kept changing — a stale lastmod tells Google\n\"nothing changed, no need to recrawl,\" directly counterproductive right\nafter a real fix. scripts/prerender.mjs now generates dist/sitemap.xml\nfrom the same source-of-truth data it already reads (staticPageMeta.js,\nposts.js, landingPages.js), so lastmod dates track real content and the\nURL list can''t drift from the actual routes. public/sitemap.xml is kept\nonly as a dev/preview fallback, commented to say it''s overwritten at\nbuild time and shouldn''t be hand-edited.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a2842f37c4fc97dee954eb9ebc0001a19d357fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/trees/2a2842f37c4fc97dee954eb9ebc0001a19d357fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/commits/7c8110e0f93af7a73572275be0c944b80f95c155","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","id":195638313,"login":"WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","node_id":"U_kgDOC6k0KQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commit/7c8110e0f93af7a73572275be0c944b80f95c155","node_id":"C_kwDOUOpGWNoAKDdjODExMGUwZjkzYWY3YTczNTcyMjc1YmUwYzk0NGI4MGY5NWMxNTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commit/c341f116b5d527baae43ae77f03257d450dd922b","sha":"c341f116b5d527baae43ae77f03257d450dd922b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/c341f116b5d527baae43ae77f03257d450dd922b"}],"sha":"7c8110e0f93af7a73572275be0c944b80f95c155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/7c8110e0f93af7a73572275be0c944b80f95c155"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","id":195638313,"login":"WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","node_id":"U_kgDOC6k0KQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/c341f116b5d527baae43ae77f03257d450dd922b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:37:03Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:37:03Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"message":"Fix the real cause of \"Crawled - currently not indexed\": head-only prerender\n\nRoot cause: index.html''s <title>/canonical/meta were hardcoded to the\nhomepage for EVERY route. Any crawler reading raw HTML before running JS —\nincluding Googlebot''s first crawl pass, which precedes its separate,\nresource-constrained rendering pass — saw a canonical pointing at \"/\" on\nevery single URL. That''s a direct duplicate-of-homepage signal, and the\nmost likely explanation for pages sitting in \"Crawled - currently not\nindexed\" in Search Console.\n\nAdded scripts/prerender.mjs, run automatically after `vite build`: writes\na per-route static copy of index.html (e.g.\ndist/blog/peg-ratio-explained/index.html) with that route''s real title,\ndescription, canonical, OG/Twitter tags, and BreadcrumbList/\nSoftwareApplication/BlogPosting/Article/FAQPage/ItemList JSON-LD already\nbaked in. Vercel serves these literal static files ahead of the SPA\ncatch-all rewrite, so non-JS crawlers get correct per-route <head> data\nimmediately, without waiting on Seo.jsx''s client-side useEffect.\n\nThis does NOT prerender visible body content (still client-rendered React)\n— only <head> metadata. Full SSR remains a bigger, separate project, per\nCLAUDE.md''s existing honest framing, now updated to describe exactly what\nthis does and doesn''t fix.\n\nExtracted buildBreadcrumbJsonLd/buildAppJsonLd out of Seo.jsx into a new\nshared src/utils/pageJsonLd.js so the Node prerender script and the React\nruntime component use the identical logic — no drift between what''s\nbaked into the static HTML and what Seo.jsx injects after hydration.\nNew src/content/staticPageMeta.js is the source of truth for the ~27\nstatic (non-blog, non-landing-page) routes'' title/description, read by\nboth the prerender script and (implicitly, by convention) each page''s own\n<Seo> call — keep them in sync when either changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4329537a5aae8840f562695ab7aaeb09b3ca2061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/trees/4329537a5aae8840f562695ab7aaeb09b3ca2061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/commits/c341f116b5d527baae43ae77f03257d450dd922b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","id":195638313,"login":"WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","node_id":"U_kgDOC6k0KQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commit/c341f116b5d527baae43ae77f03257d450dd922b","node_id":"C_kwDOUOpGWNoAKGMzNDFmMTE2YjVkNTI3YmFhZTQzYWU3N2YwMzI1N2Q0NTBkZDkyMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commit/a0daf8908623f77731d9583fb7ec563633844fb9","sha":"a0daf8908623f77731d9583fb7ec563633844fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/a0daf8908623f77731d9583fb7ec563633844fb9"}],"sha":"c341f116b5d527baae43ae77f03257d450dd922b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/c341f116b5d527baae43ae77f03257d450dd922b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","id":195638313,"login":"WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","node_id":"U_kgDOC6k0KQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/a0daf8908623f77731d9583fb7ec563633844fb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:29:12Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T18:29:12Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"message":"Deepen gold-silver-ratio and zakat posts toward the 2,000-2,500 word target\n\ngold-silver-ratio-explained: 780 -> 1,381 words (added historical context,\nmining-supply dynamics, a worked decision example, a common-mistake\nsection, and how it fits a broader metals strategy).\nzakat-on-gold-with-examples: 601 -> 999 words (added the lunar-year\neligibility nuance, combined gold+cash zakat calculation with a third\nworked example, and a common recheck-each-year mistake).\n\nBoth posts are real, substantive additions — not repeated/padded text.\nRemaining 13 posts + 10 landing pages are still at their prior ~500-900\nword length; bringing all of them to the 2,000-2,500 target is a large\nmulti-session undertaking, continuing in further batches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec68fb4a98ea8397fa409f59ab3770f01e91a26a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/trees/ec68fb4a98ea8397fa409f59ab3770f01e91a26a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/commits/a0daf8908623f77731d9583fb7ec563633844fb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","id":195638313,"login":"WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","node_id":"U_kgDOC6k0KQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commit/a0daf8908623f77731d9583fb7ec563633844fb9","node_id":"C_kwDOUOpGWNoAKGEwZGFmODkwODYyM2Y3NzczMWQ5NTgzZmI3ZWM1NjM2MzM4NDRmYjk","parents":[{"html_ur