},"message":"Add category hero images (Wikimedia Commons, verified license) + 5 more landing pages expanded\n\n- One representative image per category (Metals/Markets/Tools), reused\n  across all posts/pages in that category rather than 25 bespoke images.\n  Sourced from Wikimedia Commons (license verified via the Commons API\n  before downloading: 2 public-domain/CC0, 1 CC BY-SA 4.0 with visible\n  on-page attribution), downloaded and resized/compressed locally to\n  public/images/blog/ rather than hotlinked.\n- BlogPost.jsx/LandingPage.jsx render the category image below the\n  title, with a credit caption when the license requires one.\n- 5 more landing pages expanded to full depth (gold-price-per-gram,\n  24k-vs-22k-gold-difference, best-time-to-buy-gold, gold-investment-for-\n  beginners, silver-investment-guide, crypto-portfolio-diversification-\n  guide, understanding-stock-trade-signals, savings-goal-vs-lump-sum-gold,\n  jewelry-making-charges-explained — 9 of 10 landing pages now done).\n\nWord-count target revised to 2,000-2,500/post per explicit user decision\n(down from an initially-requested 4,000-5,000, which risked padded\nlow-value content) — existing posts/pages will be brought up to this\ntarget in a follow-up pass; this batch and earlier ones are currently at\n~500-800 words.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b17ccc639080822e95e8032b85f980f136c842c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/trees/b17ccc639080822e95e8032b85f980f136c842c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/commits/bcdb567dffd7aeeb505dea8e599ad1c2459f1bd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/u