","node_id":"U_kgDOC6k0KQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/ee1be915e4b25681180911f7ed703298a9cfb82a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T14:06:00Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T14:06:00Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"message":"Fix robots.txt group inheritance, scaffold GA4 + Search Console\n\n- robots.txt: Disallow: /widget now repeated in every named-bot group, not\n  just the wildcard one — groups don''t inherit, so it was previously only\n  honored by generic crawlers, not GPTBot/ClaudeBot/etc by name.\n- index.html: gtag.js snippet added immediately after <head>, unconditional\n  (no consent gate, matching AdSense) — placeholder G-XXXXXXXXXX measurement\n  ID, clearly marked, needs the real one.\n- index.html: google-site-verification meta tag added (HTML-tag method,\n  URL-prefix property per the request) — placeholder token, clearly marked.\n- AdSlot.jsx: documented that every `slot` prop across call sites is an\n  internal placeholder label, not a real AdSense ad-unit ID yet.\n- AdSense/ads.txt/meta tag/AdSlot component were already built to spec in\n  earlier sessions — no changes needed there.","tree":{"sha":"1bf50535267cbfd74154bb54362bdcb639550ea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabd