/brain, linked from Home.\n- public/llms.txt: static, non-JS-readable summary of every route, for LLM\n  crawlers that don''t render JavaScript.\n- public/robots.txt: explicit Allow entries for named AI crawlers (GPTBot,\n  ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended, CCBot, etc.) — redundant with\n  the wildcard rule but unambiguous.\n- CLAUDE.md: documents the real limitation this doesn''t solve — the site is\n  a client-rendered SPA, so route-specific content/meta/JSON-LD only exists\n  after JS runs, invisible to non-JS AI crawlers. llms.txt is a mitigation,\n  not a fix; true fix would be prerendering/SSG, not attempted here.","tree":{"sha":"aef33750118d187b6a0f5b1940b024c200b7e5ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/trees/aef33750118d187b6a0f5b1940b024c200b7e5ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/commits/e9ce867621feff27eee191ddb76a5fa3cc39fded","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","id":195638313,"login":"WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","node_id":"U_kgDOC6k0KQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/starred{/owner}{/repo}"