a/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/870cb83d3af7f4d2a801ebde645bc58f896ae148/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T10:19:20Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T10:19:20Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"message":"Add crypto move alerts, correlation check, and a Crude Oil page\n\n- Crypto watchlist: 1h % move alerts (threshold configurable, notifies once\n  per crossing) and a correlation check across watchlist+portfolio coins\n  (% of days moved same direction over 30d — crude proxy, not Pearson).\n  Both crypto-only: metals/stocks have no historical price API here.\n- New /crude-oil page: WTI/Brent price via USO/BNO ETF proxies (Finnhub has\n  no direct commodities feed) + general market news filtered by oil\n  keywords. Added to appRoutes, App.jsx routes, sitemap, and brain index\n  per .claude/rules/brain-sync.md.\n- Migrated all existing brain/feature/*.md files from bullet-style metadata\n  to YAML frontmatter to match the brain-sync convention.","tree":{"sha":"04731075cd334d760a6aac73ef4020a3ab7f8fea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/trees/04731075cd334d760a6aac73ef4020a3ab7f8fea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/commits/870cb83d3af7f4d2a801ebde645bc58f896ae148","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://