eepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/673e81cf3ebee7c7e93c5973140a86cfbd1becc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T18:08:52Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T18:08:52Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"message":"Add feature inventory brain, solo-repo deploy docs, and Google AdSense wiring\n\n- .claude/brain/feature/: 24 numbered feature files + index, source of truth is src/appRoutes.js + App.jsx routes. Referenced from CLAUDE.md.\n- .claude/rules/branching.md: documented the required `npx vercel --prod --yes` deploy step after every push (this repo has no git-integrated auto-deploy).\n- AdSense: utils/adsense.js (client ID placeholder + gated script loader), utils/adConsent.js (consent storage), CookieConsentBanner.jsx (Accept/Decline, script only loads post-accept), AdSlot.jsx now renders a real <ins class=\"adsbygoogle\"> when configured+consented else the existing placeholder, public/ads.txt, google-adsense-account meta tag, /privacy-policy page linked from the footer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72c17f43f8dd8224b1f73001804ad98647417e59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/trees/72c17f43f8dd8224b1f73001804ad98647417e59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/commits/673e81cf3ebee7c7e93c5973140a86cfbd1becc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/followers","following_url":"https://api.githu