b.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/commits/bf08b8258b91573747725a1d248b2b70612e2ff7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T19:22:21Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T19:22:21Z","email":"rabdeepsinghkharbanda29@gmail.com","name":"Rabdeepsingh-Beaconstac"},"message":"Add per-timeframe (15m/1h/1D/1mo/3mo) crypto trade signals using real technical indicators (SMA crossover, RSI, momentum) computed from CoinGecko''s market_chart price series — each timeframe gets its own independent Buy/Sell/Hold verdict.\n\nStocks equivalent is blocked: Finnhub''s free tier returns \"no access\" for /stock/candle (confirmed already caught gracefully in StockPriceChart.jsx), so no historical/intraday data exists to compute from. Added an honest note on the Stocks page pointing to Crypto instead of building a fake version.\n\nExtracted the SVG line-path helper (previously duplicated in Sparkline.jsx and StockPriceChart.jsx) into utils/sparklinePath.js, now shared by 3 components.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ed8f32e66ad3ed7df702fa6ddba8bed89b84fe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/trees/1ed8f32e66ad3ed7df702fa6ddba8bed89b84fe3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/MetalCalc/git/commits/bf08b8258b91573747725a1d248b2b70612e2ff7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195638313?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WorkRabdeepSinghKharbanda/foll