https://api.github.com/users/dev-araujo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dev-araujo","id":97068163,"login":"dev-araujo","node_id":"U_kgDOBckkgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dev-araujo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dev-araujo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dev-araujo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dev-araujo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dev-araujo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dev-araujo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-araujo/crypto-tracker-mfe/commits/aa80e5db617cc4e91a028655a1aa5d71fbe4779f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:49:20Z","email":"theriancirculo@protonmail.com","name":"araujo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T20:49:20Z","email":"theriancirculo@protonmail.com","name":"araujo"},"message":"fix(deploy): move per-app build settings into the Vercel projects\n\nA remote build reads vercel.json from the repository root, so the\nper-app files under deploy/ never applied: --local-config only affects\na local build, and every project ended up running build:shell. On top of\nthat, npm only runs the prebuild hook for `build`, never for\n`build:<app>`, so the environment files and the federation manifest were\nnever generated.\n\nThe root config now carries only what all four share - the SPA rewrite\nand the CORS headers for remoteEntry.json - while each project owns its\nbuild command and output directory, with the generators called\nexplicitly. The README documents the settings and the live URLs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0151zPR5ShEZdi4rY5CAPkGn","tree":{"sha":"23d5618ae48070e42574b435952bbf18e528a89d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-araujo/crypto-tracker-mfe/git/trees/23d5618