 with progress in flight,\n\"Retry dispatch\" after a carrier refusal) and markDelivered (available in\ntransit), publishing shipment.dispatched / shipment.delivered with the\norder id; ShipmentsView, ShipmentsPage, component stories on hand-built\nstates, and page stories with two play tests on a fake carrier that\nrefuses the first dispatch.\n\nPlan: humble-view/2026-09-04-1547-dispatch-demo\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"091e7405dd8315ea7b4759b9fc553bf93a829165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhotomancerArt/humble-ui-stack/git/trees/091e7405dd8315ea7b4759b9fc553bf93a829165"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhotomancerArt/humble-ui-stack/git/commits/ef721d87b91697cf4eadfc4114c193a47675134e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1108386?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yona-Appletree","id":1108386,"login":"Yona-Appletree","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDgzODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PhotomancerArt/humble-ui-stack/commit/ef721d87b91697cf4eadfc4114c193a47675134e","node_id":"