nt builders, and the world providers\n(provideFakeBackend, provideAdmin, provideAgent, provideOrders,\nprovideShipments) under @humble/backend/testing.\napp-core: AuthService with Http and Fake implementations and a contract\nsuite run against both (Http via the in-process routes), HttpClient with\nprovideHttpClient / provideInProcessHttp / readResult, DispatchEvent,\nprovideEvents, AppContext. ux-core gains provideClock / provideFakeClock\nand re-exports describe/expect for contract suites.\n\nPlan: humble-view/2026-09-04-1547-dispatch-demo\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed22bdcf840cfd684f24f04b123c75f131e43dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhotomancerArt/humble-ui-stack/git/trees/ed22bdcf840cfd684f24f04b123c75f131e43dae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhotomancerArt/humble-ui-stack/git/commits/2438e04bbdc64fbdcdc0258512a7f4ae38dc33ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1108386?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yona-Appletree","id":1108386,"login":"Yona-Appletree","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDgzODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree