"hypher@gmail.com","name":"Yona Appletree"},"message":"feat(ui): design tokens, shadcn core components, and the Storybook app\n\nui-design: Tailwind 4 theme with the shadcn CSS variables for light and\ndark plus success/warning/info tokens; Swatches and Typography stories.\nui-core: Button, Badge, Dialog, DropdownMenu, Table, Tooltip, Toaster\ncopied in with `shadcn add` (new-york, Radix), imports pointed at a local\ncn(); stories per component and the Dialog play test.\napps/storybook: Storybook 10 react-vite with addon-docs, addon-a11y,\naddon-themes, and addon-vitest running play tests in Playwright Chromium\nvia `vitest run --project storybook`; CI installs Chromium.\n\nPlan: humble-view/2026-09-04-1547-dispatch-demo\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"54953d4c0db1d1a7c724a1ba7e4f13ab11498ca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhotomancerArt/humble-ui-stack/git/trees/54953d4c0db1d1a7c724a1ba7e4f13ab11498ca7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PhotomancerArt/humble-ui-stack/git/commits/c0d1b6dd2ee334f2eee79745e5f7804c83c3a249","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1108386?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Yona-Appletree","id":1108386,"login":"Yona-Appletree","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDgzODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yona-Appletree/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/