ail.com","name":"Keiichiro Ono"},"message":"fix(claude-bridge): persist log entries across tab switches\n\nMove log state from React useState to module-level logStore.ts using\nuseSyncExternalStore pattern. Event listeners registered at module load\ntime (not inside useEffect), so entries accumulate even when panel tab\nis not selected.\n\n- logStore.ts: entries[], connected flag, subscribe/getSnapshot API\n- BridgePanel.tsx: useSyncExternalStore(subscribe, getSnapshot), add\n  Clear button\n- CommandLog.tsx: import LogEntry from logStore (single source of truth)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f72738ac6e9ad1a85f4ae0ebde895b76e9db9a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/keiono/cy-agent-bridge/git/trees/9f72738ac6e9ad1a85f4ae0ebde895b76e9db9a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/keiono/cy-agent-bridge/git/commits/26b4e3741f0c0646f56f22af785d1d041e4cf6dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73890?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/keiono","id":73890,"login":"keiono","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/keiono","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/keiono/cy-agent-bridge/com