les/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echarles","id":226720,"login":"echarles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/764ba08e4ed1d2eb2880494b3090a19df2b57dc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T03:19:29Z","email":"226720+echarles@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eric Charles"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T03:19:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"hatch_build.py: install the interface''s and the plugin''s dependencies when absent (#4)\n\n* hatch_build.py: install the interface''s and the plugin''s dependencies when absent\n\nThey are packages of their own, not workspace members, so nothing hoists\nthem; after a git clean the interface resolved whatever rsbuild the\nworkspace hoisted (1.7, with an SWC plugin mismatch: ''The version of the\nSWC Wasm plugin you''re using might not be compatible'') instead of the 2.x\nit declares. Installed when node_modules is missing, as CI does. Proven\nfrom a clean export with app/node_modules wiped: the wheel builds and\ncarries both halves.\n\n* hatch_build.py: the plugin is a workspace member when there is a workspace\n\nplugins/* is in the workspace''s globs, so its dependencies are hoisted\nand an npm install inside it would redirect to the whole workspace;\nonly a plain checkout installs it. The interface is never a member.","tree":{"sha":"d4484adeab61f74d7bb6dd4110e1c1e430c55550","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/trees/d4484adeab61f74d7bb6dd4110e1c1e430c55550"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/commits/764ba08e4ed1d2eb2880494b3090a19df2b57dc9","verification":{"payload":"tree d4484adeab61f74d7bb6dd4110e1c1e430c55550\nparent 662fba082a1a12c9bc0087e47d62b84bcdd3c66b\nauthor Eric Charles <226720+echarles@users.noreply.github.com> 1790392769 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790392769 +0200\n\nhatch_build.py: install the interface''s and the plugin''s dependencies when absent (#4)\n\n* hatch_build.py: install the interface''s and the plugin''s dependencies when absent\n\nThey are packages of their own, not workspace members, so nothing hoists\nthem; after a git clean the interface resolved whatever rsbuild the\nworkspace hoisted (1.7, with an SWC plugin mismatch: ''The version of the\nSWC Wasm plugin you''re using might not be compatible'') instead of the 2.x\nit declares. Installed when node_modules is missing, as CI does. Proven\nfrom a clean export with app/node_modules wiped: the wheel builds and\ncarries both halves.\n\n* hatch_build.py: the plugin is a workspace member when there is a workspace\n\nplugins/* is in the workspace''s globs, so its dependencies are hoisted\nand an npm install inside it would redirect to the whole workspace;\nonly a plain checkout installs it. The interface is never a member.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtznBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwbsQAJ+S/3ixk0EfUroUwD7z9Uwg\nNvHB8M28k/fMsKAQPI7nTJgj8pwA3zsF5Q7ObOwKhZVGPAnIP9jldC4XiD96j2ma\neyC4TLVcUHbhCm53SP5y17541f40X9QFmiMcfMVylqR9fl1LZ/uR/e5CYc/QqhFp\nr2iHTc7BH4ozvuD6Nmsrrxuh8XLfkT0youhRDMRhf7jmxYz86GX2wXMR+NzJ9OLF\nGQ0zEB41qpHS0qisgOmbq0dL9y2BdoFpkcqdqWaSv9X9p8RjhSzrRDwPQahQ2LGh\nrJJbLZBLKgyoje1E43Oh1Bg9O6pCju+l7PaCR7jYmFjiYrqQS1s+zy+w4Lwvf/2j\nb582rQZsXDIpi8xrXnGocO5a+j+WvYeubUb6wu46+wEPPwe9BhNXvuCFBihUFWHq\nR4/KQj+oC8Rgf0i9RScyZNr+h3oCQpHEQ9HhK