charles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echarles","id":226720,"login":"echarles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/662fba082a1a12c9bc0087e47d62b84bcdd3c66b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T03:07:29Z","email":"226720+echarles@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Eric Charles"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T03:07:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"1.0.3, one version everywhere; CI and tag-driven release; bump script (#3)\n\nVersions: datalayer_decks/__version__.py is the one source (hatch reads\nit; the CLI and extension manifests import it), the three package.json\nfiles are copies, and dev/bump_version.py (make bump-patch|minor|major)\nmoves all four or none. Aligned on 1.0.3, above every published number\n(npm @datalayer/decks 1.0.2, decks-plugin-ai-agents 1.0.1; PyPI has no\ndatalayer-decks yet).\n\nci.yaml builds and tests both halves on push and pull request; release.yaml\npublishes on a v* tag through trusted publishing (environments pypi and\nnpm): the wheel and sdist of datalayer-decks, @datalayer/decks and\n@datalayer/decks-plugin-ai-agents. Both check the reactor out beside the\nrepository at REACTOR_REF, the layout the TypeScript configuration\nresolves @datalayer/reactor from. RELEASE.md documents it.\n\nWhat a plain checkout lacked and the workspace hoisted, found by building\nfrom clean exports: @types/node (the typecheck covers src/__tests__); a\nprocess shim, stream, assert and prettier 3''s estree plugin reachable\nfrom the plugin''s own node_modules (absolute aliases in app/rsbuild.config.ts,\nthe primer-addons checkout alias now conditional on the checkout being\nthere); the federation entry named remoteEntry.js as extension.py expects\n(@module-federation/rsbuild-plugin 2.x hashes it by default); and the\nbuilt share/ halves declared as hatch artifacts, without which the\ngit-ignored files were left out of the wheel''s shared-data. repository and\npublishConfig on the two published package.json files, for npm provenance.","tree":{"sha":"cd9c836950d5a817a812d39a02db0c6c33fece1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/trees/cd9c836950d5a817a812d39a02db0c6c33fece1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/commits/662fba082a1a12c9bc0087e47d62b84bcdd3c66b","verification":{"payload":"tree cd9c836950d5a817a812d39a02db0c6c33fece1e\nparent 7e49763f61acb29e98172eaa6f8a16a3035aafa1\nauthor Eric Charles <226720+echarles@users.noreply.github.com> 1790392049 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790392049 +0200\n\n1.0.3, one version everywhere; CI and tag-driven release; bump script (#3)\n\nVersions: datalayer_decks/__version__.py is the one source (hatch reads\nit; the CLI and extension manifests import it), the three package.json\nfiles are copies, and dev/bump_version.py (make bump-patch|minor|major)\nmoves all four or none. Aligned on 1.0.3, above every published number\n(npm @datalayer/decks 1.0.2, decks-plugin-ai-agents 1.0.1; PyPI has no\ndatalayer-decks yet).\n\nci.yaml builds and tests both halves on push and pull request; release.yaml\npublishes on a v* tag through trusted publishing (environments pypi and\nnpm): the wheel and sdist of datalayer-decks, @datalayer/decks and\n@datalayer/decks-plugin-ai-agents. Both check the reactor out beside the\nrepository at REACTOR_REF, the layout the TypeScript configuration\nresolves @datalayer/reactor from. RELEASE.md documents it.\n\nWhat a plain checkout lacked and the workspace hoisted, found by building\nfrom clean exports: @types/node (the typecheck covers src/__tests__); a\nprocess shim, stream, assert and prettier 3''s estree plugin reachable\nfrom the plugin''s own node_modules (absolute aliases in app/rsbuild.config.ts,\nthe primer-addons checkout alias now conditional on the checkout being\nthere); the federation entry named remoteEntry.js as extension.py expects\n(@module-federation/rsbuild-plugin 2.x hashes it by default); and the\nbuilt share/ halves declared as hatch artifacts, without which the\ngit-ignored files were left out of the wheel''s shared-data. repository and\npublishConfig on the two published package.json files, for npm provenance.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtzbxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1mIQACZcPOt4m2T7HmU5nYPwgZKc\nsM89FThFFofXpxldaMvwYOWdvJ04D9AX8s/KS1fZxdH2M5e4Q6ZD0ZVC9WeY6r3K\nBLvHxbogavDb9JBHV6MCr8ifB2VHq2zkv3aUlOm5fXsNRKgYk2CpbRLMNSsPQEnV\nq2NcMjANPl0FE2MexQNMrTzxoNp7ROZWg3Qe8zh7PlNxGzPpdOZDCJgRAuQwZTc5\n/Pea0wQHpUOFfgMhk8qZDS5OmcI13D+QGrE7y6B3uomsoRx8YkWNQaDvwVJLg6Ea\n3GbD593BA9w9gP9uyzKaOa/s+qmnMNBr2nflgqqLeziHLXKErtLm0DMqE+nKk6pq\nvkAhrSdx4lRmZeydID8PzK8r6AdIyLeUDoLLtMi7kiVaOD4Nw7wbedm+e0IfRdCP\nbE0X+PL6x3Sh6f1OgVLGliNPldsFe/YUExsOA49qD4DYfVZYTazJilFP5IYk+xfz\nl9BXprO6/S0eL/Xw6Z8OYKjgFPeheEUXR6JC819Lrnx6Eu1n02gNXwMxwveioCdN\nR/Jee00sP9GfoHGjEJh7qIYPU1KRcK4FPHFeXrO4SwFdFtkwzCOXFVsvYXL8hv7v\nLPl+/zgNo9xlWsyi6FX6co49hOl/R2BT2LMdZb4DhG698f39R9OYxx8RnCWyOgce\nNLipUtX/pz+hJ1FdCl94\n=xMZ7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-26T03:07:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo