","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/747b37361fd37145c85ed6918ffbcf2cbaada0cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echarles","id":226720,"login":"echarles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/31547ff32ee2804563946f1ba92ae7b44fd86def/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:38:02Z","email":"eric@datalayer.io","name":"Eric Charles"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:38:02Z","email":"eric@datalayer.io","name":"Eric Charles"},"message":"ai-agents: name the inference service always, as cms-astro/ai-agents does\n\nThe plugin set `aiInferenceUrl` in the core store only when the server\nnamed one, leaving the chat to whatever the store held otherwise — a value\nanother application on the same origin may have left there. Now the store\nis set before the first render every time: the server''s URL, else the one\nthe app was built with (`DATALAYER_AI_INFERENCE_URL`, the twin of the\ncms-astro example''s `VITE_DATALAYER_AI_INFERENCE_URL`), else the plugin''s\ndefault, the Datalayer cloud where a temporary key comes from.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0ca14185c7949fc87446fa1865c25262ae473de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/trees/d0ca14185c7949fc87446fa1865c25262ae473de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/commits/31547ff32ee2804563946f1ba92ae7b44fd86def","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echarles","id":226720,"login":"echarles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datalayer/decks/commit/31547ff32ee2804563946f1ba92ae7b44fd86def","node_id":"C_kwDOUO2d_NoAKDMxNTQ3ZmYzMmVlMjgwNDU2Mzk0NmYxYmE5MmFlN2I0NGZkODZkZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datalayer/decks/commit/151c79d07e3c5347d0ed96ffd465f4ce4fedb5fb","sha":"151c79d07e3c5347d0ed96ffd465f4ce4fedb5fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/151c79d07e3c5347d0ed96ffd465f4ce4fedb5fb"}],"sha":"31547ff32ee2804563946f1ba92ae7b44fd86def","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/31547ff32ee2804563946f1ba92ae7b44fd86def"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echarles","id":226720,"login":"echarles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/151c79d07e3c5347d0ed96ffd465f4ce4fedb5fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:22:02Z","email":"eric@datalayer.io","name":"Eric Charles"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T09:22:02Z","email":"eric@datalayer.io","name":"Eric Charles"},"message":"plugin: three slide tools for an agent beside an open deck; make example-ai\n\n`decks_list_slides`, `decks_get_slide` and `decks_add_slide` take the deck\nid optionally and act on the open deck without it — what an agent sitting\nbeside a deck reaches for (\"what is on slide 3\", \"add a closing slide\") —\nanswering with the least that serves: an outline, one slide, the deck\nafter an append, shown. Registered by the browser plugin and by the Python\ntwin under the same ids; the bundle (`agentTools.json`, 18 commands) and\nthe tests keep the two equal.\n\n`make example-ai` serves the welcome deck with the AI agents plugin;\n`make example-ai-install` installs what it needs. The plugin runs the\nreference `example-decks` agent by default (the landing''s editor runs its\npitch-deck sibling on the same toolset), and its runtime component is\n`DecksAgent`, since it never was specific to one spec.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9765a559e44c9975ddb5bd4cd46bf82f8b35631","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/trees/c9765a559e44c9975ddb5bd4cd46bf82f8b35631"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/commits/151c79d07e3c5347d0ed96ffd465f4ce4fedb5fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echarles","id":226720,"login":"echarles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/datalayer/decks/commit/151c79d07e3c5347d0ed96ffd465f4ce4fedb5fb","node_id":"C_kwDOUO2d_NoAKDE1MWM3OWQwN2UzYzUzNDdkMGVkOTZmZmQ0NjVmNGNlNGZlZGI1ZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/datalayer/decks/commit/f9be3c14b5b00c0cbc82d02c3a0307082883e01a","sha":"f9be3c14b5b00c0cbc82d02c3a0307082883e01a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/f9be3c14b5b00c0cbc82d02c3a0307082883e01a"}],"sha":"151c79d07e3c5347d0ed96ffd465f4ce4fedb5fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/151c79d07e3c5347d0ed96ffd465f4ce4fedb5fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echarles","id":226720,"login":"echarles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/commits/f9be3c14b5b00c0cbc82d02c3a0307082883e01a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:52:37Z","email":"eric@datalayer.io","name":"Eric Charles"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T08:52:37Z","email":"eric@datalayer.io","name":"Eric Charles"},"message":"plugins/ai-agents: the Pitcher beside the decks, on a temporary key\n\nA frontend reactor plugin, `@datalayer/decks-plugin-ai-agents`, that puts a\nfloating chat in the host''s root slot with the `worker-pitcher` agentspec:\nagent-runtimes'' browser harness (no runtime), a temporary inference key —\nor the signed-in member''s token — counting down in the panel header, and\nevery command the decks plugin contributes to `AgentTools` as its tools,\nread from the reactor rather than declared. The same shape as the reactor''s\ncms-astro/ai-agents example, as a plugin instead of a mount hook.\n\n`datalayer decks serve --reactor-plugins ai-agents` names it: the host\nanswers `GET /config` with the plugins it was started with (and\n`DATALAYER_AI_INFERENCE_URL`), the app reads that before its first render\nand builds the named entries of `OPTIONAL_PLUGINS` into its reactor.\n\nRsbuild: the plugin''s source aliased in; Primer''s `experimental` subpath\naliased exactly (a prefix alias or `dedupe` bypasses its `exports` map);\n`@datalayer/primer-addons` pinned to the workspace checkout, which\nagent-runtimes and jupyter-lexical are built against; `next/navigation`\nand `next/router` stubbed, since core''s navigation adapter requires them\nin a try/catch and rspack would otherwise bundle Next.js.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e57071711d22e624354cbc21e5fd9d80baeb8e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/trees/4e57071711d22e624354cbc21e5fd9d80baeb8e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/datalayer/decks/git/commits/f9be3c14b5b00c0cbc82d02c3a0307082883e01a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226720?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/echarles","id":226720,"login":"echarles","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNjcyMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/echarles/subscriptions","type":"User","url"