.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commits/df9ce5baeedb42bce59444a6cf72789ed357cfaf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commits/9bcd78edefaf399723b85d92b05f4906ba4d855f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:36:49Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:36:49Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"message":"chore(front): add Angular gitignore and track the MSW worker\n\nTemplate.Front had no .gitignore of its own, so dist/ and .angular/cache showed up\nas 103 untracked files after every build. Mirror the one WorldOfWarcraft.Front uses.\n\nThe MSW service worker is generated by ''msw init public/'' but has to be committed\nfor the mocks to boot, which is what WorldOfWarcraft.Front already does.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"7231db4a81b1562f03531cc0067ec5e9c5cad0f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/git/trees/7231db4a81b1562f03531cc0067ec5e9c5cad0f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/git/commits/9bcd78edefaf399723b85d92b05f4906ba4d855f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commit/9bcd78edefaf399723b85d92b05f4906ba4d855f","node_id":"C_kwDOUPEcLtoAKDliY2Q3OGVkZWZhZjM5OTcyM2I4NWQ5MmIwNWY0OTA2YmE0ZDg1NWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commit/e3a1edaed86ec03bd8486f2ee33ab7454f56962a","sha":"e3a1edaed86ec03bd8486f2ee33ab7454f56962a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commits/e3a1edaed86ec03bd8486f2ee33ab7454f56962a"}],"sha":"9bcd78edefaf399723b85d92b05f4906ba4d855f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commits/9bcd78edefaf399723b85d92b05f4906ba4d855f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commits/e3a1edaed86ec03bd8486f2ee33ab7454f56962a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:19:47Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T09:19:47Z","email":"alexandre.colombel@septeo.com","name":"Alexandre COLOMBEL"},"message":"fix(front): declare eva-icons and align @bari77 packages on 0.8.1\n\nThe playground imports NbEvaIconsModule, and @nebular/eva-icons declares eva-icons\nas a peer dependency. Template.Front installs with --legacy-peer-deps, which skips\npeers, so eva-icons never reached the lockfile and the build failed to resolve it.\nDeclare it directly, as WorldOfWarcraft.Front already does.\n\nAlso pin gc-msw, gc-playground, gc-sdk and gc-theme to 0.8.1 (they were on 0.4.1)\nand drop the caret on gc-ui, so every @bari77 entry matches the DevKit lockstep.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"491c34fd5275704021bd2a99a75193caebf04848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/git/trees/491c34fd5275704021bd2a99a75193caebf04848"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/git/commits/e3a1edaed86ec03bd8486f2ee33ab7454f56962a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commit/e3a1edaed86ec03bd8486f2ee33ab7454f56962a","node_id":"C_kwDOUPEcLtoAKGUzYTFlZGFlZDg2ZWMwM2JkODQ4NmYyZWUzM2FiNzQ1NGY1Njk2MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commit/0c7f8b182ee68f7fa209d85c9fb4d5b9e011aa5c","sha":"0c7f8b182ee68f7fa209d85c9fb4d5b9e011aa5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Bari77/GamersCommunity.Games.Template/commits/0c7f8b182e