,"email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"message":"Link the CometVisu project from the readme\n\nThe ioBroker repository listing requires a link to the project the adapter\nintegrates (\"there must be a link to the device description or the\nmanufacturer''s website\"). The readme pointed at npm, the workflow and\niobroker.web, but never at CometVisu itself.","tree":{"sha":"314e843600ae67b4bac786f3f3bba4d44eea8ba6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/trees/314e843600ae67b4bac786f3f3bba4d44eea8ba6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/commits/66b70a6e726311f19ad808d677c1d7f75d4ecbef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11374987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke","id":11374987,"login":"joltcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzc0OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commit/66b70a6e726311f19ad808d677c1d7f75d4ecbef","node_id":"C_kwDOUPGd4toAKDY2YjcwYTZlNzI2MzExZjE5YWQ4MDhkNjc3YzFkN2Y3NWQ0ZWNiZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commit/c732730ebb2bb