,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/bbea35294bf8f534718dcffbc4999f52eeac1171/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:58:21Z","email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:58:21Z","email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"message":"Drop node 20 from the test matrix\n\nThe tests could not install the package any more: the ioBroker test action sets\nengine-strict, so npm ci fails with EBADENGINE on a node 20 runner as soon as\nengines requires 22 - and fail-fast took the rest of the matrix down with it.\n\nNode 20 was left in because the checker lists it under\nrequiredMatrixNodeVersions, but that list is filtered by the engines minimum\nbefore it is applied (M3000_Testing.js:1459-1468). With engines at 22, node 20\nis neither required nor valid, so keeping it would have raised W3024 too.","tree":{"sha":"ba049c9ec94bf9723cf4cc0791f591f005fa58df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/trees/ba049c9ec94bf9723cf4cc0791f591f005fa58df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/commits/bbea35294bf8f534718dcffbc4999f52eeac1171","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11374987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke","id":11374987,"login":"joltcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzc0OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commit/bbea35294bf8f534718dcffbc4999f52eeac1171","node_id":"C_kwDOUPGd4toAKGJiZWEzNTI5NGJmOGY1MzQ3MThkY2ZmYmM0OTk5ZjUyZWVhYzExNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commit/420fe66b3472f9b8e03829153740607217ca6653","sha":"420fe66b3472f9b8e03829153740607217ca6653","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/420fe66b3472f9b8e03829153740607217ca6653"}],"sha":"bbea35294bf8f534718dcffbc4999f52eeac1171","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/bbea35294bf8f534718dcffbc4999f52eeac1171"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11374987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke","id":11374987,"login":"joltcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzc0OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/420fe66b3472f9b8e03829153740607217ca6653/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:55:24Z","email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T08:55:24Z","email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"message":"Fix what the adapter checker reports\n\nThe anonymous checker at adapter-check.iobroker.in aborts on its own 404 for\nrepo.iobroker.live/sources-dist-latest.json, so it never reached the modules for\nworkflows, admin UI and github configuration. The logged-in run at\niobroker.dev/adapter-check does, and reported 23 errors.\n\nnode.js 22 is now the minimum (engines, check-and-lint and deploy jobs follow;\nthe test matrix stays at 20/22/24, which is what the checker requires). The\nadmin page carries all eleven languages ioBroker ships, the web instance field\ndeclares all five responsive sizes, and the admin dependency moves to 7.6.17.\nBuilt-in modules are imported with the node: prefix and the admin build task\nthrows instead of calling process.exit(), which compact mode cannot survive.\nDependabot runs on cron with a seven day cooldown and covers src-admin;\nautomerge moves to the ioBroker bot organisation''s action, which needs no\npersonal access token.\n\nexpress 5, TypeScript 6, axios and tar are updated. TypeScript 7 is not\npossible: the newest typescript-eslint (8.69.0) declares support for\n>=4.8.4 <6.1.0, and @iobroker/eslint-config pins typescript-eslint to ^8.\nTypeScript 6 in turn insists on an explicit rootDir once outDir is set, which\ntsconfig.json now spells out.","tree":{"sha":"8ef6eab8776b16eba82f2a318fff067c0f020bb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/trees/8ef6eab8776b16eba82f2a318fff067c0f020bb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/co