d the workflow that publishes from now on. The README and\nthe description were already in that package.","tree":{"sha":"6da31302f0660fec8dd5c0d71d0e51de7c6b9441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/trees/6da31302f0660fec8dd5c0d71d0e51de7c6b9441"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/commits/764aaa4ae21d7fe08d6f5f6e6be2a1f0130d9cfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11374987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke","id":11374987,"login":"joltcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzc0OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commit/764aaa4ae21d7fe08d6f5f6e6be2a1f0130d9cfc","node_id":"C_kwDOUPGd4toAKDc2NGFhYTRhZTIxZDdmZTA4ZDZmNWY2ZTZiZTJhMWYwMTMwZDljZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commit/bacbc9c716266627c1b8c54a0f2b43461f0551fb","sha":"bacbc9c716266627c1b8c54a0f2b43461f0551fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/bacbc9c716266627c1b8c54a0f2b43461f0551fb"}],"sha":"764aaa4ae21d7fe08d6f5f6e6be2a1f0130d9cfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/764aaa4ae21d7fe08d6f5f6e6be2a1f0130d9cfc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11374987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke","id":11374987,"login":"joltcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzc0OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/bacbc9c716266627c1b8c54a0f2b43461f0551fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T14:12:19Z","email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T14:12:19Z","email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"message":"Prepare the adapter for publication\n\nThe description still claimed an own web server on its own port, which the\nadapter has not had since the visualisation moved to iobroker.web. It is now\nstated from the user''s side, in package.json and in all eleven languages of\nio-package.json, and the keywords lost \"webserver\" and gained \"ioBroker\" - the\nadapter checker asks for the latter, spelled exactly that way, and already has\nthat warning marked as a future error.\n\nThe README was still the developer manual create-adapter leaves behind, the one\nthat says it can be deleted later. In its place: what is required, how to set it\nup, how delivery works, and how to upload a build of your own.\n\nThe deploy job of the workflow is active. It runs on version tags after the\ntests and publishes through trusted publishing, so no token is kept in the\nrepository. Sentry stays out - this adapter does not use it, and the job would\nonly have failed on a secret that does not exist.\n\nAlso dropped \"www/\" from the packed files, a directory that does not exist, and\nwrote repository.url the way npm expects it, which removes a publish warning.","tree":{"sha":"7c7e170761cd70eb6a5339147cdb19ff03ef8ba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/trees/7c7e170761cd70eb6a5339147cdb19ff03ef8ba8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/commits/bacbc9c716266627c1b8c54a0f2b43461f0551fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11374987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke","id":11374987,"login":"joltcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzc0OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commit/bacbc9c716266627c1b8c54a0f2b43461f0551fb","node_id":"C_kwDOUPGd4toAKGJhY2JjOWM3MTYyNjY2MjdjMWI4YzU0YTBmMmI0MzQ2MWYwNTUxZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commit/9e4ffd1bd4471c571c31ba81d7170db792448518","sha":"9e4ffd1bd4471c571c31ba81d7170db792448518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/9e4ffd1bd4471c571c31ba81d7170db792448518"}],"sha":"bacbc9c716266627c1b8c54a0f2b43461f0551fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/bacbc9c716266627c1b8c54a0f2b43461f0551fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11374987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke","id":11374987,"login":"joltcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzc0OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/commits/9e4ffd1bd4471c571c31ba81d7170db792448518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:10:43Z","email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T09:10:43Z","email":"jolt@tuxbox.org","name":"Florian Schirmer"},"message":"Serve CometVisu from ioBroker\n\nThe adapter keeps the selected CometVisu build ready on disk and lets\niobroker.web deliver it: common.webExtension mounts build/lib/web.js under\n/cometvisu, so the login, session and socket of that web instance protect and\nsupply the visualisation. There is no own web server.\n\nThe build is either an official release, downloaded from GitHub and unpacked\nper tag, or an archive uploaded through the admin, unpacked into its own\ndirectory per file name so switching back costs no unpacking. Whatever is no\nlonger referenced is removed at startup, and the settings of a former own web\nserver are cleaned out of the instance once.\n\nThe admin offers one combined version list, backed by a custom Module\nFederation component, and the extension tells CometVisu which backend to\nconnect to through the X-CometVisu-Backend headers.","tree":{"sha":"e539413db9d2ce2374a436456f0c6647b9219d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/trees/e539413db9d2ce2374a436456f0c6647b9219d46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/joltcoke/ioBroker.cometvisu/git/commits/9e4ffd1bd4471c571c31ba81d7170db792448518","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11374987?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joltcoke","id":11374987,"login":"joltcoke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzc0OTg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joltcoke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.githu