"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/commits/eba23304eb898827ae8e9df34fe58b88bb32940a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:31:48Z","email":"alamhafidz61@gmail.com","name":"Alam Wibowo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:31:48Z","email":"alamhafidz61@gmail.com","name":"Alam Wibowo"},"message":"deploy: predictable image tags + runtime-safe upstream conf\n\n- docker-compose: explicit image: tags (go-enterprise-api, mock-idp) so\n  Makefile k8s-build/k8s-push and the K8s manifests reference the same\n  image names; removes Docker-inferred && project-name-suffixed tags\n- nginx: upstream go_api block moved to /etc/nginx/upstream.conf written\n  by entrypoint (APP_UPSTREAM_API), since nginx.conf is a read-only\n  bind mount and sed -i cannot replace it (Resource busy)\n- Makefile: fix IMG_PREFIX trailing-whitespace from inline comment that\n  broke docker -t (unrecognized -g flag), fix mock-idp push source tag\n- kubernetes: imagePullPolicy IfNotPresent so kind/minikube use locally\n  built images instead of hitting a registry","tree":{"sha":"7e21ba53f2906363f2e2027dc8a5de0bb22ce520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/git/trees/7e21ba53f2906363f2e2027dc8a5de0bb22ce520"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/git/commits/eba23304eb898827ae8e9df34fe58b88bb32940a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74449662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/snipkode","id":74449662,"lo