,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/commits/b387c7841091ac3a8ac710bbd3d4e50230a74345/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:23:35Z","email":"alamhafidz61@gmail.com","name":"Alam Wibowo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:23:35Z","email":"alamhafidz61@gmail.com","name":"Alam Wibowo"},"message":"docs: deployment automation + docs (Makefile, Kubernetes, gateway image)\n\n- Makefile: setup/install/build-frontend, compose targets (deploy,\n  redeploy, health, logs), Go toolchain (fmt/vet/swag), and Kubernetes\n  targets (k8s-secret/build/push/apply/delete/logs)\n- Kubernetes: kustomize manifests (namespace, configmap, secret,\n  postgres StatefulSet+PVC+Service, redis, mock-idp, gateway+api in one\n  pod sharing the registry emptyDir -> NodePort 30080)\n- Gateway image Dockerfile (nginx + hardened config + baked console dist,\n  APP_UPSTREAM_API substitution for same-pod k8s deployment)\n- Docs: ENVIRONMENT.md, SWAGGER.md, GATEWAY.md; README updated (console,\n  registry, deployment, endpoints, layout)","tree":{"sha":"5cd002f682668089de904d516cf4328263b65843","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/git/trees/5cd002f682668089de904d516cf4328263b65843"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/git/commits/b387c7841091ac3a8ac710bbd3d4e50230a74345","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74449662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/snipkode","id":74449662,"login":"snipkode","n