i.github.com/users/snipkode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/commits/f74760ed5707baa80216aab4391db932012f19c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:17:22Z","email":"alamhafidz61@gmail.com","name":"Alam Wibowo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:17:22Z","email":"alamhafidz61@gmail.com","name":"Alam Wibowo"},"message":"feat(console): Apple-style mobile-first UI + micro frontend architecture\n\n- Redesign admin console with an Apple-inspired design system:\n  iOS palette, SF-like type, frosted top bar, inset grouped lists,\n  segmented controls, iOS-style toggles\n- Mobile-first: desktop sidebar, iOS bottom tab bar on small screens,\n  compact paddings, larger touch targets, safe-area aware\n- Micro frontends: each feature (registry, simulator, monitoring, docs)\n  is an independently built ESM module (own vite lib build + style.css),\n  composed at runtime by an app shell via mf-manifest.json + dynamic\n  import; shared lib/ (api, toast) + theme CSS keep them self-contained\n- New shell: MicroHost loader, guard-protected router, Dashboard & Login\n  rewritten around the new design system","tree":{"sha":"a54925478b63800ba75d81027f450ad34a6d9102","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/git/trees/a54925478b63800ba75d81027f450ad34a6d9102"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/git/commits/f74760ed5707baa80216aab4391db932012f19c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74449662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.c