e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/commits/7cad0764f7cbfc15affc2cd1febda1112ea17bc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:00:21Z","email":"alamhafidz61@gmail.com","name":"Alam Wibowo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T10:00:21Z","email":"alamhafidz61@gmail.com","name":"Alam Wibowo"},"message":"feat: API Gateway management console with dynamic registry\n\n- Gateway registry CRUD (migrations/010): register & expose upstream APIs\n- Generated per-API nginx configs on a shared volume, hot-reloaded by a\n  watcher in the gateway entrypoint (per-API includes + zones.conf)\n- JWT protection of registered routes via nginx auth_request -> /internal/auth\n- Monitoring: health probes (30s) + nginx access-log aggregation to Redis\n  (daily counters + recent ring)\n- Vue 3 + Tailwind 4 admin console served at /admin/ (login, registry,\n  config simulator, monitoring, Swagger UI docs)\n- Mock IdP (Go 1.25-safe) with stable sub for E2E SSO; full docs","tree":{"sha":"8755e8f2f41f09d9d89681f9346773108a174e75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/git/trees/8755e8f2f41f09d9d89681f9346773108a174e75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/snipkode/Go-gateway-api/git/commits/7cad0764f7cbfc15affc2cd1febda1112ea17bc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74449662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snipkode/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/snipkode","id":74449662,"login":"snipkode","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0NDQ5NjYy","o